helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Dukungan Platform Java				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089				0	id	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0650.xhp\" name=\"Java Platform Support\"\>Dukungan Platform Java\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	id	$[officename] mendukung platform Java untuk menjalankan berbagai aplikasi dan komponen yang bebasis pada arsitektur JavaBeans.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	id	Agar $[officename] dapat mendukung platform Java, Anda harus memasang perangkat lunak Java 2 Runtime Environment. Saat memasang $[officename], Anda akan secara otomatis menerima pilihan untuk memasang berkas-berkas tersebut jika mereka belum pernah dipasang sebelumnya. Anda juga bisa memasang berkas-berkasnya sekarang jika perlu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	id	Dukungan terhadap platform Java harus diaktifkan pada $[officename] untuk bisa menjalankan aplikasi-aplikasi Java.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	id	Untuk mengaktifkan dukungan platform Java, adalah dengan menklik menu \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferensi\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Perkakas - Opsi\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/java.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Java\"\>$[officename] - Java\</link\>\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id9116183				0	id	Before you can use a JDBC driver, you need to add its class path. Choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Java, and click the Class Path button. After you add the path information, restart %PRODUCTNAME.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822				0	id	Your modifications at the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Java\</emph\> tab page will be used even if the Java Virtual Machine (JVM, a virtual machine for the Java platform) already has been started. After modifications to the ClassPath you must restart $[officename]. The same is true for modifications under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Internet - Proxy\</emph\>. Only the two boxes "HTTP Proxy" and "FTP Proxy" and their ports don't require a restart, they will be evaluated when you click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Pemrograman $[officename]				20181231 09:50:43
