helpcontent2	source\text\smath\main0106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155959				0	id	Use this menu to open and edit the symbol catalog, or import an external formula as a data file or via clipboard. The program interface can be adjusted to meet your requirements. You can also change the program options.				20181231 09:50:43
