helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155413				0	id	To convert degrees to radians, multiply degrees by Pi/180, and to convert radians to degrees, multiply radians by 180/Pi.				20181231 09:50:43
