helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090412.xhp	0	help	par_id3147559				0	id	Only valid within a \<emph\>Do...Loop\</emph\> statement to exit the loop. Program execution continues with the statement that follows the Loop statement. If \<emph\>Do...Loop\</emph\> statements are nested, the control is transferred to the loop in the next higher level.				20181231 09:50:43
