helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030101.xhp	0	help	par_id3143267				0	id	Returns a \<emph\>Date\</emph\> value for a specified year, month, or day.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147264				0	id	Sintaksis:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	id	DateSerial (tahun, bulan, hari)				20181231 09:50:43
