helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	id	Returns the position for the next writing or reading in a file that was opened with the open statement.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	par_id3153194				0	id	For random access files, the Seek function returns the number of the next record to be read.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020304.xhp	0	help	par_id3161831				0	id	For all other files, the function returns the byte position at which the next operation is to occur.				20181231 09:50:43
