helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155150				0	id	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03132000.xhp\" name=\"CreateUnoListener Function [Runtime]\"\>CreateUnoListener Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	id	Creates a Listener instance.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153681				0	id	Many Uno interfaces let you register listeners on a special listener interface. This allows you to listen for specific events and call up the appropriate listener method. The CreateUnoListener function waits for the called listener interface and then passes the interface an object that the interface supports. This object is then passed to the method to register the listener.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148685				0	id	Sintaks:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143228				0	id	oListener = CreateUnoListener( PrefiksNama, NamaAntarmukaPenyimakaAtauListener)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147574				0	id	Contoh:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154046				0	id	Contoh berikut berdasarkan pustaka objek pada Basic.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155136				0	id	Dim oListener				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944				0	id	oListener = CreateUnoListener( "ContListener_","com.sun.star.container.XContainerListener" )				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	id	The CreateUnoListener method requires two parameters. The first is a prefix and is explained in detail below. The second parameter is the fully qualified name of the Listener interface that you want to use.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	id	The Listener must then be added to the Broadcaster Object. This is done by calling the appropriate method for adding a Listener. These methods always follow the pattern "addFooListener", where "Foo" is the Listener Interface Type, without the 'X'. In this example, the addContainerListener method is called to register the XContainerListener:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154164				0	id	Dim oLib				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154940				0	id	oLib = BasicLibraries.Library1 ' Library1 harus ada!				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150359				0	id	oLib.addContainerListener( oListener ) ' Mendaftarkan penyimak (listener)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	id	The Listener is now registered. When an event occurs, the corresponding Listener calls the appropriate method from the com.sun.star.container.XContainerListener Interface.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148922				0	id	The prefix calls registered Listeners from Basic-subroutines. The Basic run-time system searches for Basic-subroutines or functions that have the name "PrefixListenerMethode" and calls them when found. Otherwise, a run-time error occurs.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03132000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150768				0	id	Dalam contoh ini, Antarmuka-Penyimak (Listener-Interface) menggunakan metode-metode berikut:				20181231 09:50:43
