helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	id	Returns the access mode or the file access number of a file that was opened with the Open statement. The file access number is dependent on the operating system (OSH = Operating System Handle).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3153364				0	id	If you use a 32-Bit operating system, you cannot use the FileAttr-Function to determine the file access number.				20181231 09:50:43
