helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3144766				0	id	\<emph\>Attribute:\</emph\> Integer expression that indicates the type of file information that you want to return. The following values are possible:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3147396				0	id	1: The FileAttr-Function indicates the access mode of the file.				20181231 09:50:43
