helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080102.xhp	0	help	par_id3146985				0	id	radian=(degree*pi)/180				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080102.xhp	0	help	par_id3152885				0	id	Pi is here the fixed circle constant with the rounded value 3.14159...				20181231 09:50:43
