helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090403.xhp	0	help	par_id3148452				0	id	\<emph\>Argumentlist:\</emph\> List of parameters representing arguments that are passed to the procedure when it is called. The type and number of parameters is dependent on the executed procedure.				20181231 09:50:43
