helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3143268				0	id	Pernyataan berikut mengontrol ekseskusi dari sebuah program.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156152				0	id	A program generally executes from the first line of code to the last line of code. You can also execute certain procedures within the program according to specific conditions, or repeat a section of the program within a sub-procedure or function. You can use loops to repeat parts of a program as many times as necessary, or until a certain condition is met. These type of control statements are classified as Condition, Loop, or Jump statements.				20181231 09:50:43
