helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150616				0	id	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03100100.xhp\" name=\"CBool Function [Runtime]\"\>CBool Function [Runtime]\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136				0	id	Converts a string comparison or numeric comparison to a Boolean expression, or converts a single numeric expression to a Boolean expression.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153345				0	id	Sintaks:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	id	CBool (Expression1 {= | <> | < | > | <= | >=} Expression2) or CBool (Number)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156152				0	id	Nilai hasil:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	id	Bool				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147530				0	id	Parameter:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156344				0	id	\<emph\>Expression1, Expression2:\</emph\> Any string or numeric expressions that you want to compare. If the expressions match, the \<emph\>CBool\</emph\> function returns \<emph\>True\</emph\>, otherwise \<emph\>False\</emph\> is returned.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149655				0	id	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> Any numeric expression that you want to convert. If the expression equals 0, \<emph\>False\</emph\> is returned, otherwise \<emph\>True\</emph\> is returned.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	id	The following example uses the \<emph\>CBool\</emph\> function to evaluate the value that is returned by the \<emph\>Instr\</emph\> function. The function checks if the word "and" is found in the sentence that was entered by the user.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156212				0	id	Contoh:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147288				0	id	Sub ExampleChoose				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	id	Dim sText As String				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155132				0	id	sText = InputBox("Please enter a short sentence:")				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855				0	id	REM Proof if the word »and« appears in the sentence.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146984				0	id	REM Instead of the command line				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148576				0	id	REM If Instr(Input, "and")<>0 Then...				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154014				0	id	REM the CBool function is applied as follows:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155413				0	id	If CBool(Instr(sText, "and")) Then				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940				0	id	MsgBox "The word »and« appears in the sentence you entered!"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153954				0	id	End If				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152886				0	id	End Sub				20181231 09:50:43
