helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\flowcharts.xhp	0	help	par_idN10567				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Flowchart toolbar from which you can insert graphics into your document.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
