helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\colortoolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id1676381				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>With the Color toolbar you can edit some properties of the selected object.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\colortoolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id5855281				0	id	To open the Color toolbar, click the Color icon on the Picture toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
