helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN111E8				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SCROLLVALUE_MIN\"\>Specify the minimum value of a scrollbar control.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
