helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153031				0	id	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>If you click the \<emph\>Decrease Indent\</emph\> icon while holding down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>key, the indent for the selected paragraph is moved by the default tab stop that has been set under \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"Writer - General\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - General\</emph\>\</link\> in the Options dialog box.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
