helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147574				0	id	Grayscale				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	id	The graphic object is shown in grayscale. A color graphic object can become monochrome in grayscale. You can also use the color sliders to apply a uniform color to the monochrome graphic object.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151246				0	id	Black and White				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153062				0	id	The graphic object is shown in black and white. All brightness values below 50% will appear black, all over 50% will appear white.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146795				0	id	Watermark				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	id	The graphic object is raised in brightness and reduced in contrast so that it can be used in the background as a watermark. 				20181231 09:50:43
