helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829	2			0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Saves the current database table record.\</ahelp\> The\<emph\> Save Record \</emph\>icon is found on the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0212.xhp\" name=\"Database Bar\"\>Table Data bar\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\07070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152372				0	id	Changes to the contents of a record are automatically saved as soon as you select another record. To save changes without selecting another record, click the \<emph\>Save Record\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Form-based Filters				20181231 09:50:43
