helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154230				0	id	\<variable id=\"formfiltertext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormFilter\"\>Prompts the database server to filter the visible data by specified criteria.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152918				0	id	Unlike the normal search, which is activated by the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12100200.xhp\" name=\"Find Record\"\>Find Record\</link\> icon on the \<emph\>Form\</emph\> Bar, you can search more quickly by using the form-based filter. Usually a quick database server is charged with the search. Also, you can enter more complex search conditions.				20181231 09:50:43
