helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:IMAGEBUTTON:RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_DOCUMENT:BTN_BROWSE\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Target in Document\</emph\> dialog.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153320				0	id	URL				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880				0	id	Specifies the URL, which results from the entries in \<emph\>Path\</emph\> and \<emph\>Destination\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
