helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145601				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NumericField\"\>Creates a numerical field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the numerical values in the form can be adopted from the database.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153612				0	id	Currency Field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145324				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id3152866\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_currencyfield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152866\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145115				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CurrencyField\"\>Creates a currency field.\</ahelp\> If the form is linked to a database, the currency field contents for in the form can be adopted from the database.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148825				0	id	Pattern Field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149742				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id3148924\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertpatternfield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148924\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150122				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PatternField\"\>Creates a pattern field.\</ahelp\> Pattern fields consist of an edit mask and a literal mask. The edit mask determines which data can be entered. The literal mask determines the contents of the pattern field when loading the form.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152947				0	id	Please note that pattern fields are not exported into HTML format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145147				0	id	Group Box				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159334				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id3153790\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_groupbox.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153790\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154572				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:GroupBox\"\>Creates a frame to visually group several controls.\</ahelp\> Group boxes allow you to group option buttons in a frame.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148394				0	id	If you insert a group frame into the document, the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01120000.xhp\" name=\"Group Element Wizard\"\>Group Element Wizard\</link\> starts, which allows you to easily create an option group.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150567				0	id	\<emph\>Note:\</emph\> When you drag a group box over already existing controls and then want to select a control, you have to first open the context menu of the group box and choose \<emph\>Arrange - Send to Back\</emph\>. Then select the control while pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145615				0	id	Group boxes are used only for a visual effect. A functional grouping of option fields can be made through the name definition: under the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Name\"\>\<emph\>Name\</emph\>\</link\> properties of all option fields, enter the same name in order to group them.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157996				0	id	Table Control				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156402				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id3146324\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_grid.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3146324\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154579				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Creates a table control to display a database table.\</ahelp\> If you create a new table control, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170800.xhp\" name=\"Table Element Wizard\"\>Table Element Wizard\</link\> appears.				20181231 09:50:43
