helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B3D				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_NAVIGATIONBAR\"\>Creates a navigation bar.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11DB1				0	id	The navigation bar allows you to move through the records of a database or a database form. The controls on this navigation bar work the same way as the controls on the default \<link href=\"text/shared/main0213.xhp\"\>navigation bar\</link\> in $[officename].				20181231 09:50:43
