helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	id	Places the cursor into the previous line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	id	Panah Bawah				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	id	Places the cursor into the next line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153178				0	id	Enter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147228				0	id	Completes the input in the field and places the cursor into the next field.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	id	As with list boxes or combo boxes, you can open or close the list with a mouse click at the arrow on the right end of the field. However, the input here can be entered either in the opened list or in the top text field. An exception is the properties that expect a list representation, for example, the property \<emph\>List Entries\</emph\>, which can be set for the control fields \<emph\>List Box\</emph\> and \<emph\>Combo Box\</emph\>. Here, you can only edit the entries when the field is opened.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154228				0	id	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170901.xhp\" name=\"Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection\"\>Combo Box / List Box Wizard: Table Selection\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	id	Specifies a table from the available database tables that contains the data field whose content should be displayed as a list entry.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3153114				0	id	For list boxes, a table that can be linked with the current form table is indicated. The link table must have at least one field in common with the table of the current form. This makes it possible to establish an unambiguous reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	id	For combo boxes, there must be a relationship between the form table and the table containing the data to be displayed in the combo box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170901.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147226				0	id	Table				20181231 09:50:43
