helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090100.xhp	0	help	par_idN105EE				0	id	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/guide/filters.xhp#filters\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155555				0	id	Filter criteria				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147834				0	id	You can define a filter by indicating the type of line, the name of the field, a logical condition and a value or a combination of arguments.				20181231 09:50:43
