helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10760				0	id	Select the highlighted text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02160000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149784				0	id	On the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> bar, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Highlighting\</emph\> icon, and then click \<emph\>No Fill\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170003.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Special Tips for Date Fields				20181231 09:50:43
