helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000099.xhp	0	help	par_id3156069				0	id	On the help page for \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/main.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] general\"\>$[officename] general\</link\> you can find instructions that are applicable to all modules, such as working with windows and menus, customizing $[officename], data sources, Gallery, and drag and drop.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000099.xhp	0	help	par_id3149662				0	id	If you want help with another module, switch to the help for that module with the combo box in the navigation area.				20181231 09:50:43
