helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000099.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067C				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ActiveHelp\"\>Enables the display of a brief description of menus and icons at the mouse pointer.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000099.xhp	0	help	par_id6200750				0	id	Some of the shortcut keys may be assigned to your desktop system. Keys that are assigned to the desktop system are not available to %PRODUCTNAME. Try to assign different keys either for %PRODUCTNAME, in \<emph\>Tools - Customize - Keyboard\</emph\>, or in your desktop system.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	ASCII Filter Options				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146856				0	id	ASCII Filter Options				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3153070				0	id	You can specify which options, such as basic font, language, character set, or break, are imported or exported with a text document. The dialog appears when you load an ASCII file with the filter "Text Encoded" or when you save the document the first time, or when you "save as" with another name.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159217				0	id	Properti				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3155577				0	id	Defines the settings for importing or exporting your file. When exporting, only the character set and paragraph break can be defined.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146959				0	id	Character set				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3143206				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_ASCII_FILTER:LB_CHARSET\"\>Specifies the character set of the file for export or import.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154926				0	id	Default fonts				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3151262				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_ASCII_FILTER:LB_FONT\"\>By setting a default font, you specify that the text should be displayed in a specific font. The default fonts can only be selected when importing.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154894				0	id	Language				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000215.xhp	0	help	par_id3153323				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:DLG_ASCII_FILTER:LB_LANGUAGE\"\>Specifies the language of the text, if this has not already been defined. This setting is only available when importing.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
