helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149651				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABDLG_RESET_BTN\"\>Resets changes made to the current tab to those applicable when this dialog was opened. A confirmation query does not appear when you close the dialog.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143278				0	id	Atur Ulang				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABDLG_RESET_BTN\"\>Resets modified values back to the default values.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154331				0	id	A confirmation query does not appear. If you confirm the dialog with OK all settings in this dialog are reset.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145173				0	id	Standar				20181231 09:50:43
