helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027				0	id	\<variable id=\"autopilot\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SID_AUTOPILOT\"\>Use the wizard to interactively create a presentation. With the wizard, you can modify the sample templates to suit your needs.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The wizard takes you step by step through the design elements and offers various editing options.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154289				0	id	The Presentation Wizard starts automatically when you open a new presentation. You can deactivate this function if you choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01070500.xhp\" name=\"Presentation - General\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Impress - General\</link\>\</emph\> and deselect the \<emph\>Start with Wizard\</emph\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	id	Within each wizard page, you can undo, modify, or skip altogether the editing steps. If you decide to skip over one of the pages, the wizard uses the default settings.				20181231 09:50:43
