helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147242				0	id	No, one particular field is not going to be selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120200.xhp	0	help	par_id3163802				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_DEFAULTFIELDSELECTION_RB_DEFSELECTION_NO\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Specifies that you do not want any option field to be the default choice.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
