helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147102				0	id	\<variable id=\"agenda\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoPilotAgenda\"\>Starts the wizard to help you create an agenda template.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> You can use an agenda to specify discussion topics for conferences and meetings.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156414				0	id	$[officename] comes with a sample template for agendas that you can modify to suit your own needs. The wizard offers numerous layout and design options for creating document templates. The preview gives you an impression of how the finished agenda will appear.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147571				0	id	Within the wizard, you can modify your entries at any time. You may also skip an entire page or even all the pages, in which case the current (or default) settings remain in effect.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147088				0	id	Balik				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	id	Returns to the selections made on the previous page. The current settings remain in effect. This button only becomes active after the first page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155391				0	id	Lanjut				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	id	The wizard saves the current settings and goes to the next page. Once you reach the last page, this button will become inactive.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145382				0	id	Selesai				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346	10			0	id	According to your selections, the wizard creates a document template and saves it on your hard disk. A new document based on the template appears in the work area, with the filename "UntitledX" (X stands for an automatic number).				20181231 09:50:43
