helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	par_id4653767				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The files are exported as PNG files. PNG files are compressed without loss of data, and can contain more than 256 colors.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
