helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149828				0	id	This page is only displayed if the document is already linked to a database.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152551				0	id	Do you want to save the value in a database field?				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154823				0	id	Yes, I want to save it in the following database field:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01120400.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_RADIOBUTTON_RID_PAGE_OPTION_DBFIELD_RB_STOREINFIELD_YES\"\>Specifies that you want to save the reference values in a database.\</ahelp\> The values are written in the data field selected in the list box. The list box displays all the field names from the database table that the form is linked to.				20181231 09:50:43
