helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3153878				0	id	Pilih \<emph\>Format - Halaman\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3149581				0	id	On the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab page, select a background color or a background graphic.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\background.xhp	0	help	par_id3154097				0	id	In spreadsheets this background appears only in the print behind the cells not formatted elsewhere.				20181231 09:50:43
