helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id3119602				0	id	Open the database file where you want to create the new report.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4226508				0	id	In the left pane of the database window, click the \<emph\>Reports\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id5758842				0	id	Click \<emph\>Create Report in Design View\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4870754				0	id	Follow the instructions in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Report Builder\</link\> guide.				20181231 09:50:43
