helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_idN105DC				0	id	Open the database file where you want to create the new report.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E0				0	id	In the left pane of the database window, click the \<emph\>Reports\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_idN105E8				0	id	Click \<emph\>Use Wizard to Create Report\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id8032166				0	id	Follow the steps of the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01100000.xhp\"\>Report Wizard\</link\> to create the report.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Menjalankan Peranti Lunak $[officename] dengan Parameter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156410				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>start parameters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>command line parameters\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>parameters;command line\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>arguments in command line\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156410				0	id	Menjalankan Peranti Lunak $[officename] dengan Parameter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147009				0	id	By starting the $[officename] software from the command line you can assign various parameters, with which you can influence the performance. The use of command line parameters is only recommended for experienced users.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147618				0	id	For normal handling, the use of command line parameters is not necessary. A few of the parameters require a deeper knowledge of the technical background of the $[officename] software technology.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154898				0	id	Menjalankan Peranti Lunak $[officename] dari Baris Perintah				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3156152				0	id	Under Windows, select \<emph\>Run\</emph\> from the Windows Start menu, or open a Shell under UNIX® based platforms.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3152472	6			0	id	Under Windows, type the following text in the \<emph\>Open \</emph\>text field and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	id	Under UNIX based systems, type the following line of text, then press \<emph\>Return\</emph\>:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147561	7			0	id	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>{install}\\program\\soffice.exe {parameter} \</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>{install}/program/soffice {parameter} \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360				0	id	Replace \<emph\>{install}\</emph\> with the path to your installation of the $[officename] software (for example, \<emph\>C:\\Program Files\\Office\</emph\>, or \<emph\>~/office\</emph\>)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\start_parameters.xhp	0	help	par_id3158407				0	id	Where required, replace \<emph\>{parameter}\</emph\> with one or more of the following command line parameters.				20181231 09:50:43
