helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_versions.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	id	The \<emph\>File\</emph\> menu contains a \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01190000.xhp\" name=\"Versions\"\>\<emph\>Versions\</emph\>\</link\> command that enables you to save multiple versions of a document in the same file.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_versions.xhp	0	help	par_id3149399				0	id	You can choose to view individual versions of a document, or you can display the differences between versions with color markings.				20181231 09:50:43
