helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1053A				0	id	\<variable id=\"formatpaintbrush\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/paintbrush.xhp\"\>Copying Formatting With the Format Paintbrush\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10655				0	id	You can use the Format Paintbrush tool to copy formatting from a text selection or from an object and apply the formatting to another text selection or object.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_id101920091122570				0	id	In Calc, the Format Paintbrush only applies to cell formatting.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DD				0	id	Select the text or object whose formatting you want to copy.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10667				0	id	On the \<emph\>Standard Bar\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10660				0	id	The cursor changes to a paint bucket.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10663				0	id	If you want to apply the formatting to more than one selection, double-click the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> icon\<image id=\"img_id209967\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formatpaintbrush.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id209967\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>. After you apply all the formatting, click the icon again.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066E				0	id	Select or click the text or object that you want to apply the formatting to.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10716				0	id	To exclude paragraph formatting, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> when you click. To exclude character formatting, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift when you click.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10671				0	id	The following table describes the formatting attributes that the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> can copy:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10691				0	id	Type of Selection				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10697				0	id	Comment				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1069E				0	id	Nothing selected, but cursor is inside a text passage				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A4				0	id	Copies the formatting of the current paragraph and the character formatting of the next character in the text flow direction.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AB				0	id	Text is selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B1				0	id	Copies the formatting of the last selected character and of the paragraph that contains the character.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B8				0	id	Frame is selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BE				0	id	Copies the frame attributes that are defined in \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Frame\</item\> dialog. The contents, size, position, linking, hyperlinks, and macros in the frame are not copied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C5				0	id	Object is selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CB				0	id	Copies the object formatting that is defined in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Graphics\</item\> or \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Drawing Object\</item\> dialogs. The contents, size, position, hyperlinks, and macros in the object are not copied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D2				0	id	Form control is selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D8				0	id	Not supported				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DF				0	id	Drawing object is selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E5				0	id	Copies all formatting attributes. In Impress and Draw, the text contents of the object is also copied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EC				0	id	Text within Calc cells is selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F2				0	id	Not supported				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F9				0	id	Writer table or cells are selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FF				0	id	Copies the formatting that is specified in Table, Text Flow, Borders, and Background tab pages in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Table\</item\> dialog. The paragraph and character formatting are also copied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10706				0	id	Calc table or cells are selected				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070C				0	id	Copies the formatting that is specified in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Cells\</item\> dialog as well as the formatting of the cell contents				20181231 09:50:43
