helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2012				0	id	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Master Pages\</item\> deck lists currently used, recently used, and available master pages. Right-click a master page thumbnail for a sub-menu to apply or edit the master page. This deck is only available for presentations.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2013				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id2013\" src=\"sfx2/res/symphony/sidebar-animation-large.png\" width=\"0.25in\" height=\"0.25in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2013\"\>Custom Animation deck\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2014				0	id	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Custom Animation\</item\> deck provides tools to apply animation effects to presentation and graphic objects on your slide. This deck is only available for presentations.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2015				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id2015\" src=\"sfx2/res/symphony/sidebar-transition-large.png\" width=\"0.25in\" height=\"0.25in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2015\"\>Slide Transition deck\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2016				0	id	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Slide Transition\</item\> deck provides tools to apply a special effect that plays when you display a slide. This deck is only available for presentations.				20181231 09:50:43
