helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10AA6				0	id	You see entries for "%PRODUCTNAME Macros" (scripts in the share directory of your %PRODUCTNAME installation), "My Macros" (scripts in the user directory), and the current document. Open any one of them to see the supported scripting languages.				20181231 09:50:43
