helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064C				0	id	Open the database file where you want to create the new query.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN10650				0	id	In the left pane of the database window, click the \<emph\>Queries\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_queries.xhp	0	help	par_idN10658				0	id	Click \<emph\>Create Query in Design View\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
