helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	id	You can customize your $[officename] to suit your needs.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3155421				0	id	Use \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Customize\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Customize\</emph\> dialog to change toolbars, menus and other user interface items.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3145071				0	id	You are free to change the items on the menu bar. You can delete items, add new ones, copy items from one menu to another, rename them, and so on.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	id	The toolbars may be freely configured.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3150443				0	id	You can change the shortcut keys.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3153345				0	id	You can change default settings of $[officename] to suit your needs.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	optid3155421				0	id	Use \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/010000000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Options\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> dialog to change a variety of settings you will use in $[officename] modules. Items presented in the \<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\> menu will change depending on the module you are using.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3145071				0	id	In \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/language_select.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - Language Settings\</emph\>\</link\>, you will find options for your default language and currency setting.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	opt3149811				0	id	In \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040000.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Options - $[officename] Writer - Basic Fonts\</emph\>\</link\>, you will find default font settings. Change these to suit your preferences. Fonts can easily be changed on per document basis.				20181231 09:50:43
