helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	id	Double-click on an existing title text. A gray border appears around the text and you can now make changes. Press Enter to create a new line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_title.xhp	0	help	par_id2706991				0	id	If no title text exists, choose \<emph\>Insert - Title\</emph\> to enter the text in a dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
