helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147008				0	id	\<variable id=\"navigator\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/navigator.xhp\" name=\"Navigator for Document Overview\"\>Navigator for Document Overview\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	id	All contents of the Navigator window are referred to here as "categories," whether titles, sheets, tables, text frames, graphics, OLE objects, sections, hyperlinks, references, indexes or comments.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3153662				0	id	The Navigator displays all types of objects contained in a document. If a plus sign appears next to a category, this indicates that at least one object of this kind exists. If you rest the mouse pointer on the category name, the number of objects is displayed in an extended tip.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	id	Open a category by clicking on the plus sign. If you only want to view the entries in a certain category, select the category and click the \<emph\>Content View\</emph\> icon. Until you click the icon again, only the objects of this category will be displayed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\navigator.xhp	0	help	par_id3166461				0	id	You may dock the Navigator to any document border or turn it back into a free window (double click on the gray area). You can change the size of the Navigator when it is a free window.				20181231 09:50:43
