helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E5				0	id	\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/xforms.xhp\"\>Dokumen Formulir XML (XForms)\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F5				0	id	XForms are a new type of web form that was developed by the World Wide Web Consortium. The XForm model is defined in Extensible Markup Language (XML). The model uses separate sections to describe what a form does and what a form looks like. You can view the specification for XForms at: \<link href=\"http://www.w3.org/MarkUp/Forms/\"\>http://www.w3.org/MarkUp/Forms/\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10746				0	id	Working with XForms				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074A				0	id	In %PRODUCTNAME, an XForms document is a special type of Writer document. The Design Mode for an XForm document has additional toolbars and panes. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074D				0	id	After you create and save an XForms document, you can open the document, fill out the form, and submit the changes to a server.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10706				0	id	To Create a New XForms Document				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070D				0	id	Choose \<emph\>File - New - XML Form Document\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10714				0	id	The XForms design window opens in an empty Writer document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10718				0	id	Design your form.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071E				0	id	Insert a control, select the default model in the property browser, and enter a binding statement.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10722				0	id	In the data navigator, add an element to the instance.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10726				0	id	Load a new instance from an XML file and add controls to the relevant XML elements or attributes.				20181231 09:50:43
