helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xforms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10730				0	id	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\> and select the XForms document. An XForm document has the same extension as a Writer text document (*.odt).				20181231 09:50:43
