helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156324				0	id	\<variable id=\"change_title\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/change_title.xhp\" name=\"Changing the Title of a Document\"\>Changing the Title of a Document\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	id	You can specify a title for your document. Some file manager utilities can display the titles next to the filenames of your documents.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156136				0	id	How to change the title of the current document				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	id	Choose \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>. This opens the \<emph\>Properties of\</emph\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	id	Select the \<emph\>Description\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3147242				0	id	Type the new title in the \<emph\>Title\</emph\> box and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
