helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id1631824				0	id	The review function is available in %PRODUCTNAME for text documents and spreadsheet documents.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	id	To protect the changes made in a document during editing, choose \<emph\>Edit - Changes - Protect Records\</emph\>. To turn off the function or to accept or reject changes it is necessary to enter the correct password first.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Protect Records\</emph\>. This opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/password_dlg.xhp\" name=\"Password\"\>\<emph\>Password\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_protect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	id	Enter a password consisting of at least 5 characters and confirm it. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
