helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149140				0	id	\<image src=\"sfx2/res/favourite.png\" id=\"img_id3149549\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149549\"\>Ikon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145314				0	id	Use the \<emph\>Add to Bookmarks\</emph\> icon to set a bookmark for the current page shown in the Help.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	id	Anda bisa menemukan penanda pada halaman tab \<emph\>Penanda\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_HELP_BOOKMARKS_LB_BOOKMARKS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Double-clicking a bookmark or pressing the Return key opens the assigned page in Help. A right-click opens the context menu.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	id	Gunakan tombol Del untuk menghapus penanda yang dipilih.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	id	The following commands are on the context menu of a bookmark:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573				0	id	\<emph\>Display\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_OPEN\" visibility=\"visible\"\>displays the selected help subject\</ahelp\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000150.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	id	\<emph\>Rename\</emph\> - \<ahelp hid=\"HID_HELP_BOOKMARKS_RENAME\" visibility=\"visible\"\>opens a dialog for entering another name for the bookmark\</ahelp\>.				20181231 09:50:43
