helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154962				0	id	Ikon dalam Dokumentasi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146961				0	id	Terdapat tiga ikon yang digunakan untuk menarik perhatian Anda pada infromasi yang sangat membantu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156152				0	id	Ikon "Penting!" mengenai informasi penting tentang keamanan data dan sistem.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153897				0	id	Ikon "Catatan" mengenai informasi tambahan: sebagai contoh, jalan alternatif untuk mencapai tujuan tertentu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154216				0	id	Ikon "Tips" mengenai tips-tips dalam bekerja dengan program untuk mencapai efisien kerja.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Agen Bantuan, Tips, dan Tips Tambahan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150672				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>Help; Help tips\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tooltips; help\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Help Agent; help\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Clippy, see Help Agent\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155599				0	id	\<variable id=\"00000120\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/05/00000120.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips\"\>Help Agent, Tips and Extended Tips\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3148520	2			0	id	Agen Bantuan, Tips, dan Tips Tambahan menyediakan bantuan sembari Anda bekerja.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147285				0	id	Agen Bantuan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	id	The \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010600.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent\"\>Help Agent\</link\> starts automatically when you are performing a task that might require some assistance. The Help Agent appears in a small window in a corner of the document. To view the help for the task, click inside the Help Agent window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10634				0	id	The Help Agent automatically closes after a short delay. If you ignore or close the Help Agent three times you perform a certain task, the Help Agent no longer opens for that task. To disable the Help Agent choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140				0	id	Tips				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3157896				0	id	Tips provide you with the names of toolbar buttons. To display a tip, rest the pointer over a toolbar button until the name of the button appears.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910				0	id	Tips are also displayed for some elements in a document, such as chapter names when you scroll through a long document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id992156				0	id	Enable or disable the tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147571				0	id	Tips Tambahan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	id	Extended tips provide a brief description about buttons and commands. To display an extended tip, press Shift+F1, then point to a button or command.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10666				0	id	If you always want extended tips instead of tips, enable the extended tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
