helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154792				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_CHECKBOX_RID_SCPAGE_CONTENT_CB_VALUE\"\>Mark the \<emph\>Value highlighting\</emph\> box to show the cell contents in different colors, depending on type. Text cells are formatted in black, formulas in green, and number cells in blue, no matter how their display is formatted.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151319				0	id	When this command is active, any colors assigned in the document will not be displayed until the function is deactivated.				20181231 09:50:43
