helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149809				0	id	Options for high contrast appearance				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153106				0	id	High contrast is an operating system setting that changes the system color scheme to improve readability. You can decide how \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> uses the high contrast settings of the operating system.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863				0	id	Cell borders and shadows are always shown in text color when high contrast mode is active. The cell background color is ignored then.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155132				0	id	Automatically detect high contrast mode of operating system				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_AUTO_DETECT_HC\"\>Switches \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> into high contrast mode when the system background color is very dark.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154918				0	id	Use automatic font color for screen display				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146984				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_AUTOMATIC_FONT_COLOR\"\>Displays fonts in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> using the system color settings. This option only affects the screen display.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153091				0	id	Use system colors for page previews				20181231 09:50:43
