helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	id	Accesses the Internet without a proxy server. Allows you to set up a connection directly on your computer to an Internet provider that does not use a proxy.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150984				0	id	Manual				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156155				0	id	Lets you enter the proxy server manually. Specify the proxy servers in accordance with your Internet service. Ask your system administrator for the proxies and ports to enter.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148943				0	id	Ketik nama server tanpa awalan protokol. Sebagai contoh, ketik www.sun.com, bukan http://www.sun.com.				20181231 09:50:43
