helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id9701528				0	id	%PRODUCTNAME uses only the RGB color model for printing in color. The CMYK controls are provided only to ease the input of color values using CMYK notation.				20181231 09:50:43
