helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595552				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click the button to show the currently collected data. This data will be sent next time, plus any data that gets collected until you end the current session.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
