helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825	2			0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS\"\>All user-defined lists are displayed in the\<emph\> Sort Lists \</emph\>dialog. You can also define and edit your own lists. Only text can be used as sort lists, no numbers.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
