helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148552				0	id	First and last characters				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149295				0	id	Defines the default settings for 'first' and 'last' characters. In the dialog that appears when you choose \<emph\>Format -\</emph\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020700.xhp\" name=\"Asian Typography\"\>\<emph\>Asian Typography\</emph\>\</link\>, you can specify whether the list of forbidden characters applies to those at the beginning or end of a line in a paragraph.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154071				0	id	Bahasa				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151210				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_LISTBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_LB_LANGUAGE\"\>Specifies the language for which you want to define first and last characters.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145606				0	id	Standar				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148920	22			0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_CB_STANDARD\"\>When you mark\<emph\> Default\</emph\>, the following two text boxes are filled with the default characters for the selected language:\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144761				0	id	Not at start of line:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156214				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_START\"\>Specifies the characters that should not appear alone at the beginning of a line.\</ahelp\> If a character typed here is positioned at the beginning of a line after a line break, it is automatically moved to the end of the previous line. For example, an exclamation point at the end of a sentence never appears at the start of a line if it is part of the \<emph\>Not at start of line\</emph\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154908				0	id	Not at end of line:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153367	26			0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_EDIT_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_ED_END\"\>Specifies the characters that should not appear alone at the end of a line.\</ahelp\> If a character typed here is positioned at the end of a line due to a line break, it is automatically moved to the beginning of the next line. For example, a currency symbol that appears in front of an amount never appears at the end of a line if it is part of the\<emph\> Not at end of line\</emph\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
