helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153663	35			0	id	A language module can contain one, two or three submodules: Spellcheck, hyphenation and thesaurus. Each sub-module can be available in one or more languages. If you click in front of the name of the module, you activate all the available sub-modules simultaneously. If you remove a set mark, you deactivate all the available sub-modules simultaneously. If you wish to activate or deactivate individual sub-modules, click the\<emph\> Edit button \</emph\>to open the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010401.xhp\" name=\"Edit Modules\"\>\<emph\>Edit Modules\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3294778				0	id	The configuration allows for two different directories: one folder where the user has write permissions, and one without write permissions. The user can only edit and delete the user dictionaries that are located in the writable path. Other dictionaries can be read only.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154307				0	id	Sunting				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673	37			0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SFXPAGE_LINGU_PB_LINGU_MODULES_EDIT\"\>To edit a language module, select it and click \<emph\>Edit\</emph\>.\</ahelp\> The \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010401.xhp\" name=\"Edit Modules\"\>\<emph\>Edit \</emph\>\<emph\>Modules\</emph\>\</link\> dialog appears.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153348				0	id	Kamus tentuan-pengguna				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155419				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_CLB_EDIT_MODULES_DICS\"\>Lists the available user dictionaries.\</ahelp\> Mark the user dictionaries that you want to use for spellcheck and hyphenation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144511				0	id	Baru				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3146794				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SFXPAGE_LINGU_PB_LINGU_DICS_NEW_DIC\"\>Opens the \<emph\>New Dictionary\</emph\> dialog, in which you can name a new user-defined dictionary or dictionary of exceptions and specify the language.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151054				0	id	Kamus Baru				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360				0	id	In the \<emph\>Dictionary\</emph\> section you can name a new user-defined dictionary or dictionary of exceptions and specify the language.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150398				0	id	Nama				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SFXDLG_NEWDICT:ED_DICTNAME\"\>Specifies the name of the new custom dictionary.\</ahelp\> The file extension "*.DIC" is automatically appended.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150767				0	id	Bahasa				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3148920				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SFXDLG_NEWDICT:LB_DICTLANG\"\>By selecting a certain language you can limit the use of the custom dictionary.\</ahelp\> By selecting \<emph\>All\</emph\> the custom dictionary is used independently of the current language.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153106				0	id	Pengecualian (-)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149561				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:CHECKBOX:RID_SFXDLG_NEWDICT:BTN_EXCEPT\"\>Specifies whether you wish to avoid certain words in your documents.\</ahelp\> In this way, you can create a custom dictionary of all the words to be avoided. If this exception dictionary is activated, during spellchecking you receive a corresponding note about any words which should be avoided.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145785				0	id	Sunting				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SFXPAGE_LINGU_PB_LINGU_DICS_EDIT_DIC\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Edit custom dictionary\</emph\> dialog, in which you can add to your custom dictionary or edit existing entries.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147436	75			0	id	In the \<emph\>Edit custom dictionary \</emph\>dialog you have the option to enter new terms or edit existing entries. If you edit an exception dictionary, the dialog has the added facility of defining an exception for a word. During the spellcheck this exception is then listed as a suggestion.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145750	76			0	id	When a dictionary is edited, a check is made on the status of the file. If the file is write-protected, it cannot be changed. The buttons \<emph\>New\</emph\> and \<emph\>Delete\</emph\> are then deactivated. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150116				0	id	Buku				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SFXDLG_EDITDICT:LB_ALLDICTS\"\>Menentukan buku yang hendak disunting.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154730	79			0	id	\<variable id=\"ignore\"\>The \<emph\>IgnoreAllList (All) \</emph\>includes all words that have been marked with \<emph\>Ignore\</emph\> during spellcheck. This list is valid only for the current spellcheck. \</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154757				0	id	The \<emph\>IgnoreAllList\</emph\> entry cannot be selected and cannot be deleted. Only the words included as content can be deleted. This happens automatically each time that $[officename] is closed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149018				0	id	Bahasa				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:LISTBOX:RID_SFXDLG_EDITDICT:LB_DICTLANG\"\>Assigns a new language to the current custom dictionary.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151189				0	id	Kata				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151252				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SFXDLG_EDITDICT:ED_WORD\"\>You can type a new word for inclusion in the dictionary. In the list below you will see the contents of the current custom dictionary.\</ahelp\> If you select a word from this list it is displayed in the text field. If you type a word with a trailing = character, such as "AutoComplete=", the word is never automatically hyphenated and no hyphenation is suggested. Typing "Auto=Complete" results in the word being hyphenated, or a hyphenation suggested, where you insert the = sign.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155175				0	id	Suggestion				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147323				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SFXDLG_EDITDICT:ED_REPLACE\"\>This input field is only available if you are editing an exception dictionary. The field shows the alternative suggestion for the current word in the "Word" text box.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147361				0	id	Baru				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3163808	89			0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SFXDLG_EDITDICT:PB_NEW_REPLACE\"\>Adds the word in the \<emph\>Word \</emph\>text field to your current custom dictionary. The word in the \<emph\>Suggestion \</emph\>field is also added when working with exception dictionaries.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3145790				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Removes the marked word from the current custom dictionary.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010400.xhp	0	help	par_id3151277				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Deletes the selected dictionary after a confirmation, provided it is not write-protected.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
