helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154730	18			0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If enabled, a copy is created when you move an object while holding down the Ctrl key (Mac: Command key).\</ahelp\> The same will apply for rotating and resizing the object. The original object will remain in its current position and size.				20181231 09:50:43
