helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149786				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_STD_FONT\"\>Specifies the settings for the basic fonts in your documents.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3152349				0	id	You can also change the basic fonts for Asian and complex text layout languages if their support is enabled in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	id	These settings define the basic fonts for the predefined templates. You can also modify or customize the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040301.xhp\" name=\"default text templates\"\>default text templates\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
