helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	hd_id31499				0	id	File encryption				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01100600.xhp	0	help	hd_id31499A				0	id	The password to open the current document can be set in the Properties dialog on the Security tab page. You can also set a password to open the document when you save the document. Check the Save with password option on the Save As dialog, and enter the password.				20181231 09:50:43
