helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020103.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	id	Ensure that the file extension corresponds to the file type of the document. For example, a Microsoft Word document must have a (*.doc) extension for $[officename] to use the appropriate filter.				20181231 09:50:43
