helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06200000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159157				0	id	Normally in a mixed text selection made of Hangul and Hanja characters, all Hangul characters will be converted to Hanja and all Hanja characters will be converted to Hangul. If you want to convert a mixed text selection only in one direction, use the following conversion options.				20181231 09:50:43
