helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020300.xhp	0	help	par_id3148491				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_NUMBERFORMAT_LB_FORMAT\"\>Select how you want the contents of the selected cell(s) to be displayed.\</ahelp\> The code for the selected option is displayed in the \<emph\>Format Code\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
