helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147261				0	id	The AutoCorrect settings are applied when you press the Spacebar after you enter a word.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153394				0	id	To turn on or to turn off the AutoCorrect feature, in $[officename] Calc choose \<emph\>Tools - Cell Contents - AutoInput\</emph\>, and in $[officename] Writer choose \<emph\>Format - AutoCorrect - While Typing\</emph\>. To apply the AutoCorrect settings to an entire text document, choose \<emph\>Format - AutoCorrect - Apply\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
