helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285074				0	id	%PRODUCTNAME Writer / Calc / Impress / Draw / Math				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285019				0	id	The tab page with the same name as the current application can be used to define the contents, color, size, and pages to be printed. You define settings that are specific to the current document type.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285112				0	id	Page Layout				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285150				0	id	The Page Layout tab page can be used to save some sheets of paper by printing several pages onto each sheet of paper. You define the arrangement and size of output pages on the physical paper.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200904164735				0	id	Change the arrangement of pages to be printed on every sheet of paper. The preview shows how every final sheet of paper will look.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200904102987				0	id	For some document types, you can choose to print a brochure.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	hd_id0818200912285138				0	id	Options				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912285146				0	id	On the Options tab page you can set some additional options for the current print job. Here you can specify to print to a file instead of printing on a printer.				20181231 09:50:43
