helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147366				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>text; font styles\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fonts; styles\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147366				0	id	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05110000.xhp\" name=\"Style\"\>Style\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155620				0	id	Use this command to quickly apply font styles to a text selection.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153255				0	id	If you place the cursor in a word and do not make a selection, the font style is applied to the entire word. If the cursor is not inside a word, and no text is selected, then the font style is applied to the text that you type.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Komentar				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154100				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>comments;inserting/editing/deleting/printing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting; comments\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>editing; comments\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>deleting;comments\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Navigator;comments\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>printing;comments\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>records; inserting comments \</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>remarks, see also comments\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
