helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06050600.xhp	0	help	par_id423291				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the element that will follow the numbering: a tab stop, a space, or nothing.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06050600.xhp	0	help	hd_id7809686				0	id	at				20181231 09:50:43
