helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151234				0	id	If you type a letter combination that matches a shortcut in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040200.xhp\" name=\"replacement table\"\>replacement table\</link\>, the letter combination is replaced with the replacement text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150144				0	id	Correct TWo INitial CApitals				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	id	If you type two uppercase letters at the beginning of a "WOrd", the second uppercase letter is automatically replaced with a lowercase letter.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156426				0	id	Capitalize first letter of every sentence.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155339				0	id	Capitalizes the first letter of every sentence.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id5240028				0	id	The first letter in a Calc cell will never be capitalized automatically.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145072				0	id	Automatic *bold* and _underline_				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153577				0	id	Automatically applies bold formatting to text enclosed by asterisks (*), and underline to text enclosed by underscores ( _ ), for example, *bold*. The asterisks and underscores are not displayed after the formatting is applied.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	id	This feature does not work if the formatting characters * or _ are entered with an \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#IME\" name=\"Input Method Editor\"\>Input Method Editor\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150275				0	id	URL Recognition				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	id	Automatically creates a hyperlink when you type a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148473				0	id	Replace Dashes				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144439				0	id	Replaces one or two hyphens with a long dash (see the following table).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id87282				0	id	Text will be replaced after you type a trailing white space (space, tab, or return). In the following table, the A and B represent text consisting of letters A to z or digits 0 to 9.				20181231 09:50:43
