helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151097				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FontWork\"\>Edits Fontwork effects of the selected object that has been created with the previous Fontwork dialog.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	id	This \<emph\>Fontwork\</emph\> dialog is only available for Fontwork in old Writer text documents that were created prior to %PRODUCTNAME %PRODUCTVERSION. You must first call \<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\> to add a menu command or an icon to open this dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154497				0	id	You can change the shape of the text baseline to match semicircles, arcs, circles, and freeform lines.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152372				0	id	Alignment icons				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FONTWORK_CTL_FORMS\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click the shape of the baseline that you want to use for the text.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152542				0	id	The top row contains the following baseline shapes: \<emph\>Upper Semicircle\</emph\>, \<emph\>Lower Semicircle\</emph\>, \<emph\>Left Semicircle\</emph\> and \<emph\>Right Semicircle\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150774				0	id	The middle row contains the following baseline shapes: \<emph\>Upper Arc\</emph\>, \<emph\>Lower Arc, Left Arc\</emph\> and \<emph\>Right Arc\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159158				0	id	The bottom row contains the following baseline shapes: \<emph\>Open Circle, Closed Circle, Closed Circle II\</emph\>, and \<emph\>Open Circle Vertical\</emph\>. For the best results, the drawing object must contain more than two lines of text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05280000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149237				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FONTWORK_TBI_STYLE_OFF\"\>Removes baseline formatting.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
