helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN10730				0	id	JPEG compression				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN10734				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Selects a JPEG compression of images. With a high quality level, almost all pixels are preserved. With a low quality level, some pixels get lost and artefacts are introduced, but file sizes are reduced.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
