helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	hd_id2796411				0	id	PDF/A-1a				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id5016327				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Converts to the PDF/A-1a format. This is defined as an electronic document file format for long term preservation. All fonts that were used in the source document will be embedded into the generated PDF file. PDF tags will be written.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A0				0	id	Tagged PDF				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A4				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Selects to write PDF tags. This can increase file size by huge amounts.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B3				0	id	Tagged PDF contains information about the structure of the document contents. This can help to display the document on devices with different screens, and when using screen reader software.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_idN107BE				0	id	Export notes				20181231 09:50:43
