helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148492				0	id	When you are working with database tables, you can only undo the last command.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155504	4			0	id	If you change the content of a record in a database table that has not been saved, and then use the\<emph\> Undo\</emph\> command, the record is erased.				20181231 09:50:43
