helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	bm_id2883388				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>UNO components;Extension Manager\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>extensions;Extension Manager\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>packages, see extensions\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN10543				0	id	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/packagemanager.xhp\"\>Extension Manager\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN10553				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"42772\"\>The Extension Manager adds, removes, disables, enables, and updates %PRODUCTNAME extensions.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN10615				0	id	The following are examples of %PRODUCTNAME extensions:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061B				0	id	UNO components (compiled software modules)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061F				0	id	Configuration data (for menu commands)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN10623				0	id	%PRODUCTNAME Basic libraries				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E8				0	id	%PRODUCTNAME dialog libraries				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F5				0	id	Extension files (*.oxt files containing one or more extensions of the above listed types)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	hd_id8570513				0	id	Extension Scope				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN1068A				0	id	Users with administrator or root privileges will see a dialog where they can choose to install extensions "for all users" or "only for me". Normal users without those privileges can install, remove, or modify extensions only for their own use.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN10626				0	id	A user with root or administrator privileges can install an extension as a shared extension that is available to all users. After selecting an extension, a dialog opens and asks whether to install for the current user or all users.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN1069C				0	id	A user without root privileges can only install an extension for own usage. This is called a user extension.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	hd_id3895382				0	id	To install an extension				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id9143955				0	id	An extension is available as a file with the file extension .oxt.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id7857905				0	id	You can find a collection of extensions on the Web. Click the "Get more extensions here" link in the Extension Manager to open your Web browser and see the \<link href=\"https://extensions.openoffice.org/\"\>https://extensions.openoffice.org/\</link\> page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	hd_id5016937				0	id	To install a user extension				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id1856440				0	id	Do any of the following:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id7654347				0	id	Double-click the \<item type=\"literal\"\>.oxt\</item\> file in your system's file browser.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id5269020				0	id	On a web page, click a hyperlink to an \<item type=\"literal\"\>*.oxt\</item\> file (if your web browser can be configured to start the Extension Manager for this file type).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id8714255				0	id	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Extension Manager\</item\> and click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Add\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	hd_id3734550				0	id	To install a shared extension in text mode (for system administrators)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id4139225				0	id	As an administrator, open a terminal or command shell.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id671712				0	id	Change to the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>\\ \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>/\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>program folder in your installation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id4163945				0	id	Enter the following command, using the path and file name of your extension:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id9581591				0	id	\<item type=\"literal\"\>unopkg add --shared path_filename.oxt\</item\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AD				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"42769\"\>Select the extension that you want to remove, enable, or disable. For some extensions, you can also open an Options dialog.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN10639				0	id	Add				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BA				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"2180256276\"\>Click Add to add an extension.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BD				0	id	A file dialog opens where you can select the extension that you want to add. To copy and to register the selected extension, click Open.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id4856410				0	id	An extension can show a license dialog. \<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Read the license. Click the Scroll Down button to scroll down if necessary. Click Accept to continue the installation of the extension.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN10643				0	id	Remove				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D1				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"2180256277\"\>Select the extension that you want to remove, and then click Remove.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id0523200810573866				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enable or disable the extension.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064D				0	id	Enable				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DE				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"2180256278\"\>Select the extension that you want to enable, and then click Enable.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN10657				0	id	Disable				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EB				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"2180256279\"\>Select the extension that you want to disable, and then click Disable.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	hd_id4453566				0	id	Update				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id4129459				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click to check for online updates of all installed extensions. To check for updates of the selected extension only, choose the Update command from the context menu. The check for availability of updates starts immediately.\</ahelp\> You will see the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/extensionupdate.xhp\"\>Extension Update\</link\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	hd_id4921414				0	id	Options				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id1439558				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select an installed extension, then click to open the Options dialog for the extension.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id0103201110331832				0	id	Some additional commands can appear in the context menu of an extension in the Extension Manager window, depending on the selected extension. You can choose to show the license text again. You can choose to exclude the extension from checking for updates or to include an excluded extension.				20181231 09:50:43
