helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\07010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158442				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:NewWindow\"\>Opens a new window that displays the contents of the current window.\</ahelp\> You can now view different parts of the same document at the same time.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\07010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147588				0	id	Changes made to a document in one window are automatically applied to all of the windows that are open for that document.				20181231 09:50:43
