helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05990000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150467				0	id	\<variable id=\"texttext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:TextAttributes\"\>Sets the layout and anchoring properties for text in the selected drawing or text object.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
