helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05250300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150794				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Moves the selected object down one level, so that it is closer to the bottom of the stacking order.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
