helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3153173				0	id	Inserts a non breaking space before ";", "!", "?" and ":" when the character language is set to French (France, Belgium, Luxembourg, Monaco, or Switzerland) and before ":" only when the character language is set to French (Canada).				20181231 09:50:43
