helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154173				0	id	Formats the text characters of ordinals, such as 1st, 2nd, or 3rd, as superscripts. For example, in English text, 1st will be converted to 1^st.				20181231 09:50:43
