helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147275				0	id	The table definition must be exactly the same so that data can be copied. Data cannot be copied if a data field in the target table has another format than the data field in the source table.				20181231 09:50:43
