helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02oracle.xhp	0	help	par_idN105FD				0	id	hostname is the name of the machine that runs the Oracle database. You can also replace hostname with the IP address of the server.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02oracle.xhp	0	help	par_idN10601				0	id	port is the port where the Oracle database listens. Ask your database administrator for the correct port address.				20181231 09:50:43
