helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabapropadd.xhp	0	help	par_idN10634				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Select the character set that you want to use to view the database in $[officename].\</ahelp\> This setting does not affect the database. To use the default character set of your operating system, select "System".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabapropadd.xhp	0	help	par_idN10651				0	id	Text and dBASE databases are restricted to character sets with a fixed-size character length, where all characters are encoded with the same number of bytes.				20181231 09:50:43
