helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabapropadd.xhp	0	help	par_idN10700				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays all the records in a file, including those marked as deleted. If you select this check box, you cannot delete records.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
