helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02ado.xhp	0	help	par_idN10568				0	id	$[officename] requires the Microsoft Data Access Components (MDAC) to use the ADO interface. Microsoft Windows 2000 and XP include these components by default. For earlier visions of Windows, you need to install MDAC separately. You can download MDAC from the Microsoft web site.				20181231 09:50:43
