helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id6504409				0	id	Anda hendak membuat rumus penjumlahan sigma seperti "jumlah dari s^k dari k = 0 hingga n" pada posisi kursor di dalam dokumen teks Writer.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id8811304				0	id	Klik menu \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sisip - Objek - Rumus\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id1276589				0	id	You see the Math input window and the Elements window. If you don't see the Elements window, you can enable it in the View menu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id3283791				0	id	In the upper part of the Elements window, click the \<emph\>Operators\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id9734794				0	id	In the lower part of the Elements window, click the \<emph\>Sum\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
