helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id6756187				0	id	Rumusnya sekarang sudah lengkap. Klik pada dokumen di luar rumus untuk meninggalkan penyunting.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id9406414				0	id	In the same way, you can enter an Integral formula with limits. When you click an icon from the Elements window, the assigned text command is inserted in the input window. If you know the text commands, you can enter the commands directly in the input window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id5866267				0	id	Klik menu \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sisip - Objek - Rumus\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id1965697				0	id	Klik pada jendela masukan, kemudian ketik baris berikut:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id9004486				0	id	int from{a} to{b} f(x)`dx				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id4651020				0	id	A small gap exists between f(x) and dx, which you can also enter using the Elements window: click the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> icon, then the \<emph\>Small Gap\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id3877071				0	id	Apabila Anda tidak menyukai jenis huruf f dan x, klik menu \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Fonta\</item\> kemudian pilih fonta yang lain. Klik tombol \<emph\>Baku\</emph\> untuk menggunakan fonta yang dipilih sebagai jenis karakter baku sejak saat itu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\limits.xhp	0	help	par_id3021332				0	id	If you need the formula within a line of text, the limits increase the line height. You can choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Text Mode\</item\> to place the limits besides the Sum or Integral symbol, which reduces the line height.				20181231 09:50:43
