helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_idN103C3				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id3148440\" src=\"starmath/res/un21215.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148440\"\>Ikon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
