helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153770				0	id	\<link href=\"text/smath/01/03040000.xhp\" name=\"Zoom In\"\>Perbesar Tampilan\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Increases the display scale of the formula by 25%.\</ahelp\> The current zoom factor is displayed on the status bar. A selection of available zoom options is accessible through the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\>. The context menu in the work area also contains zoom commands.				20181231 09:50:43
