helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id9417096				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Mengeset resolusi.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8482924				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Mengeset resolusi.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8962370				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Shows the trend line equation next to the trend line.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id6889858				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Shows the coefficient of determination next to the trend line.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8398998				0	id	Apabila Anda menyisipkan sebuah kurva regresi pada jenis bagan yang memakai kategori, seperti \<emph\>Baris \</emph\>atau \<emph\>Kolom, \</emph\>maka nomor 1, 2, 3, \<emph\>…\</emph\> akan dipakai sebagai nilai x untuk mengkalkulasikan kurva regresi.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id5676747				0	id	Untuk menyisipkan kurva regresi ke semua seri data, klik ganda bagan bersangkutan untuk memasuki mode sunting. Pilih \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sisip - Statistik\</item\>, lalu pilih jenis kurva regresi dari Tanpa, Linear, Logaritma, Eksponensial, atau Regresi Perpangkatan.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4349192				0	id	To insert a trend line for a single data series, select the data series in the chart, right-click to open the context menu, and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Trend Line\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id9337443				0	id	To delete a single trend line or mean value line, click the line, then press the Del key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4529251				0	id	To delete all trend lines, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Trend Lines\</item\>, then select \<emph\>None\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id296334				0	id	Kurva resgresi ditampilkan pada legenda secara otomatis.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4072084				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Mean Value Lines are special trend lines that show the mean value. Use \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Mean Value Lines\</item\> to insert mean value lines for data series.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id9569689				0	id	Kurva regresi memiliki warna yang sama dengan seri data bersangkutan. Untuk mengubah properti garis, pilih kurva regresi tersebut dan pilih \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Properti Objek - Garis\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id846888				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>To show the trend line equation, select the trend line in the chart, right-click to open the context menu, and choose \<emph\>Insert Trend Line Equation\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8962065				0	id	When the chart is in edit mode, %PRODUCTNAME gives you the equation of the trend line and the coefficient of determination R². Click on the trend line to see the information in the status bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id1328470				0	id	For a category chart (for example a line chart), the trend line information is calculated using numbers 1, 2, 3, … as x-values. This is also true if your data series uses other numbers as names for the x-values. For such charts the XY chart type might be more suitable.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8092593				0	id	To show the equation and the coefficient of determination, select the trend line and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Format Selection - Equation\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id7971434				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enable Show equation to see the equation of the trend line.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id558793				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enable Show Coefficient of Determination to see the determination coefficient of the trend line.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id7735221				0	id	You can also calculate the parameters using Calc functions as follows.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id5744193				0	id	Persamaan regresi linear				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id9251991				0	id	\<emph\>Linier regresi\</emph\> mengikuti persamaa \<item type=\"literal\"\>y=m*x+b\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id7951902				0	id	m = SLOPE(Data_Y;Data_X) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id6637165				0	id	b = INTERCEPT(Data_Y ;Data_X) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id7879268				0	id	Menghitung koefisien determinasi dengan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id9244361				0	id	r² = RSQ(Data_Y;Data_X) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id2083498				0	id	Selain m, b dan r², fungsi susunan (array) \<emph\>LINEST\</emph\> turut menyediakan statistik tambahan bagi analisis regresi.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id2538834				0	id	Persamaan logaritma regresi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id394299				0	id	\<emph\>Logaritma regresi\</emph\> mengikuti persamaan \<item type=\"literal\"\>y=a*ln(x)+b\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id2134159				0	id	a = SLOPE(Data_Y;LN(Data_X)) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id5946531				0	id	b = INTERCEPT(Data_Y ;LN(Data_X)) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id5649281				0	id	r² = RSQ(Data_Y;LN(Data_X)) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id7874080				0	id	Persamaan eksponensial regresi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4679097				0	id	 For exponential trend lines a transformation to a linear model takes place. The optimal curve fitting is related to the linear model and the results are interpreted accordingly. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id9112216				0	id	Regresi eksponensial mengikuti persamaan \<item type=\"literal\"\>y=b*exp(a*x)\</item\> atau \<item type=\"literal\"\>y=b*m^x\</item\>, yang mana ditransformasikan menjadi \<item type=\"literal\"\>ln(y)=ln(b)+a*x\</item\> or \<item type=\"literal\"\>ln(y)=ln(b)+ln(m)*x\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4416638				0	id	a = SLOPE(LN(Data_Y);Data_X) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id1039155				0	id	Variabel bagi variasi kedua dikalkulasikan sebagai berikut:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id7184057				0	id	m = EXP(SLOPE(LN(Data_Y);Data_X)) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id786767				0	id	b = EXP(INTERCEPT(LN(Data_Y);Data_X)) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id7127292				0	id	Menghitung koefisien dari determinasi dengan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id5437177				0	id	r² = RSQ(LN(Data_Y);Data_X) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id6946317				0	id	Selain m, b dan r² the, fungsi susunan (array) LOGEST turut menyediakan statistik tambahan bagi analisis regresi.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id6349375				0	id	Persamaan regresi perpangkatan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id1857661				0	id	 Bagi kurva \<emph\>regresi perpangkatan\</emph\>, transformasinya menjadi model linear akan mengambil tempat. Regresi perpangkatan akan mengikuti persamaan \<item type=\"literal\"\>y=b*x^a\</item\> , yang mana akan ditransformasikan menjadi \<item type=\"literal\"\>ln(y)=ln(b)+a*ln(x)\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8517105				0	id	a = SLOPE(LN(Data_Y);LN(Data_X)) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id9827265				0	id	b = EXP(INTERCEPT(LN(Data_Y);LN(Data_X)) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id2357249				0	id	r² = RSQ(LN(Data_Y);LN(Data_X)) 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id9204077				0	id	Batas				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id7393719				0	id	 Kalkulasi dari kurva regresi terdiri atas hanya pasangan data dengan nilai-nilai sebagai berikut:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id7212744				0	id	regresi logaritma: hanya nilai x positif yang diperhitungkan,				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id1664479				0	id	regresi eksponensial: hanya nilai y positif yang diperhitungkan,				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8734702				0	id	regresi perpangkatan: hanya nilai x positif dan y positif yang diperhitungkan.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id181279				0	id	Anda harus mentransformasikan data Anda sesuai situasi di atas; sangat dianjurkan Anda bekerja pada salinan data yang asli dan yang ditransformasikan adalah salinan data tersebut.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	hd_id7907040				0	id	Persamaan regresi polinomial				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8918729				0	id	Kurva \<emph\>regresi polinomial\</emph\> tidak dapat ditambahkan secara ototmatis. Anda harus menghitungnya secara manual. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id33875				0	id	Membuat tabel dengan kolom x, x², x³, … , xⁿ, y hingga derajat n yang diinginkan. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8720053				0	id	Gunakan rumus \<item type=\"literal\"\>=LINEST(Data_Y,Data_X)\</item\> dengan jangkauan lengkap x ke xⁿ (tanpa tajuk) sebagai Data_X. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id5068514				0	id	Baris pertama dari keluaran LINEST mengandung koefisien dari regresi polinomia, dengan koefisien dari xⁿ pada posisi paling kiri.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id8202154				0	id	Elemen pertama dari baris ketika keluaran LINEST adalah nilai dari r². Lihat fungsi \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060107.xhp#Section8\"\>LINEST\</link\> untuk detil dalam penggunaan dan penjelasan parameter keluaran lainnya.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050100.xhp	0	help	par_id4562211				0	id	\<link href=\"text/schart/01/04050000.xhp\"\>Halaman tab Statistik\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Scale				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150868				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>penskalaan; sumbu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>penskalaan logaritma sepanjang sumbu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>bagan;penskalaan sumbu\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sumbu X;penskalaan\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sumbu Y; penskalaan\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sumbu;tanda interval\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150868				0	id	\<link href=\"text/schart/01/05040201.xhp\" name=\"Penskalaan\"\>Penskalaan\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154013				0	id	Controls the scaling of the X or Y axis.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3148576				0	id	The axes are automatically scaled by $[officename] so that all values are optimally displayed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149379				0	id	Untuk mencapai hasil tertentu, Anda bisa secara manual mengubah skala sumbu. Sebagai contoh, Anda dapat menampilkan hanya bagian atas dari kolom dengan menarik garis nol ke atas.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154730				0	id	Scale				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400				0	id	Anda bisa memasukkan nilai untuk pensubdivisian sumbu pada area ini. Anda bisa secara otomatis mengeset lima properti \<emph\>Minimum, Maksimum. Interval mayor, Interval minor\</emph\>, dan \<emph\>Sumbu pada\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150751				0	id	Minimal				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153713				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH_SPINFIELD_TP_SCALE_EDT_MIN\"\>Defines the minimum value for the beginning of the axis.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156385				0	id	Maksimal				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3159266				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH_SPINFIELD_TP_SCALE_EDT_MAX\"\>Defines the maximum value for the end of the axis.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155336				0	id	Interval Mayor				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3143218				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH_SPINFIELD_TP_SCALE_EDT_STEP_MAIN\"\>Defines the interval for the main division of the axes.\</ahelp\> The main interval cannot be larger than the value area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154020				0	id	Tanda interval minor				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154656				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH_SPINFIELD_TP_SCALE_EDT_STEP_HELP\"\>Defines the interval for the subdivision of the axes.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150089				0	id	Reference value				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152990				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH_SPINFIELD_TP_SCALE_EDT_ORIGIN\"\>Specifies at which position to display the values along the axis.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166432				0	id	Otomatis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145389				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:CHECKBOX:TP_SCALE:CBX_AUTO_ORIGIN\"\>You must first deselect the \<emph\>Automatic\</emph\> option in order to modify the values.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149129				0	id	Matikan fitur ini apabila Anda bekerja dengan nilai-nilai "tetap", sehingga tidak akan ada penskalaan secara otomatis.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159206				0	id	Skala logaritma				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145360				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:CHECKBOX:TP_SCALE:CBX_LOGARITHM\"\>Specifies that you want the axis to be subdivided logarithmically.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153956				0	id	Gunakan fitur ini apabila Anda bekerja dengan nilai-nilai yang berbeda tajam satu dengan yang lain. Anda bisa memakai penskalaan logaritmik untuk membuat garis-garis jejaring pada sumbu yang memiliki jarak sama jauh, tetapi memiliki nilai-nilai yang mungkin meninggi atau merendah.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	hd_id9941404				0	id	Arah kebalikan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id5581835				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>\<emph\>Menentukan letak nilai terendah dan nilai tertinggi saat ditampilkan pada\</emph\>\<emph\>sumbu. Bagian yang tidak diberi ceklis adalah\</emph\> arah matematikalnya.\</ahelp\> Itu artinya, bagi sistem koordinat Kartesius dengan sumbu akan menampilkan nilai terendah pada sisi kiri sementara sumbu y akan menampilkan nilai terendah pada sisi bawah. Bagi sistem koordinat polar, arah dari sudut sumbu matematikalnya adalah searah jarum jam dan sumbu radialnya berasal dari dalam menuju ke luar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	hd_id922204				0	id	Type				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id59225				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>For some types of axes, you can select to format an axis as text or date, or to detect the type automatically.\</ahelp\> For the axis type "Date" you can set the following options.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id1159225				0	id	Minimum and maximum value to be shown on the ends of the scale.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id2259225				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Resolution can be set to show days, months, or years as interval steps.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3359225				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Major interval can be set to show a certain number of days, months, or years.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040201.xhp	0	help	par_id4459225				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Minor interval can be set to show a certain number of days, months, or years.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
