helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id3156385				0	id	To set the default printing options for $[officename] Impress, choose \<emph\>Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME Impress - Print\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
