helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3145241				0	id	To convert the data point to a smooth point, click the \<emph\>Smooth Transition\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Edit Points\</emph\> Bar.				20181231 09:50:43
