helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	id	Go to the slide where you want to insert the spreadsheet.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3146313	18			0	id	Choose \<emph\>Insert - OLE- Object\</emph\>. Click \<emph\>Create new\</emph\> and select the %PRODUCTNAME Spreadsheet. Click OK. Click in the spreadsheet to enter your data. 				20181231 09:50:43
