helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id1616565				0	id	Enable the \<emph\>Link to file\</emph\> checkbox to insert the file as a live link.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155256				0	id	The entire spreadsheet is inserted into your slide. If you want to change the sheet that is displayed, double-click the spreadsheet, and then select a different sheet.				20181231 09:50:43
