helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\masterpage.xhp	0	help	par_id3153915	26			0	id	Under \<emph\>Templates\</emph\>, select a template with the design that you want to apply. To preview the template, click \<emph\>More\</emph\>, and then select the \<emph\>Preview \</emph\>box.				20181231 09:50:43
