helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154510				0	id	\<variable id=\"palette_files\"\>\<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/palette_files.xhp\" name=\"Loading Color, Gradient, and Hatching Lists\"\>Loading Color, Gradient, and Hatching Lists\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3156385	73			0	id	You can use lists to organize colors, gradients, or hatching patterns. $[officename] provides several lists that you can load and use in your document. If you want, you can add or delete elements from a list, or even create custom lists. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155961				0	id	Untuk memuat daftar warna:				20181231 09:50:43
