helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3151239				0	id	Locate the color list that you want to load, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>. A color list file has the format [filename].soc.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3154762				0	id	Untuk menyimpan berkas gaya panah, klik tombol \<emph\>Simpan Gaya Panah\</emph\>, masukkan namanya, kemudian klik \<emph\>Oke\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149871				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>lapisan; definisi\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\palette_files.xhp	0	help	par_id3149871				0	id	The CMYK list is optimized for print colors, whereas the colors in the Web and the HTML lists are optimized for displays using a resolution of 256 colors.				20181231 09:50:43
