helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id4846339				0	id	If the system allows to span a window over all available monitors, you can also select "All monitors". In this case the presentation spans over all available monitors. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id2321543				0	id	This setting is saved in the user configuration and not inside the document.				20181231 09:50:43
