helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1080B				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Selects the additional properties of the animation. Click the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button to open the \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/effectoptions.xhp\"\>Effect Options\</link\> dialog, where you can select and apply properties.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
