helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\03130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155066				0	id	You can specify settings for running a slide show in \<link href=\"text/simpress/01/06080000.xhp\" name=\"Slide Show - Slide Show Settings\"\>\<emph\>Slide Show - Slide Show Settings\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
