helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	hd_id4544816				0	id	\<variable id=\"borders\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/borders.xhp\"\>User Defined Borders in Cells\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id2320017				0	id	You can apply a variety of different lines to selected cells.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id8055665				0	id	Select the cell or a block of cells.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id9181188				0	id	Pilih \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Sel\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id9947508				0	id	In the dialog, click the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id7907956				0	id	Choose the border options you want to apply and click OK.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id1342204				0	id	The options in the \<emph\>Line arrangement\</emph\> area can be used to apply multiple border styles.				20181231 09:50:43
