helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id8473464				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id1737113\" src=\"res/helpimg/border_ca_1.png\" width=\"1.2709inch\" height=\"1.6146inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id1737113\"\>garis tepi dengan satu sel yang dipilih\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id3509933				0	id	Sel dalam kolom				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id6635639				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id1680959\" src=\"res/helpimg/border_ca_2.png\" width=\"1.2917inch\" height=\"1.6146inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id1680959\"\>garis tepi dengan kolom yang dipilih\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
