helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10905				0	id	Pilih \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Berkas - Baru - Basis Data\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10915				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File name\</item\> box, enter a name for the file.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN1090D				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File type\</item\> box, select "Text CSV".				20181231 09:50:43
