helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id4653767				0	id	=B1="" => TRUE (MS-Excel: FALSE)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id8801538				0	id	C1: =VLOOKUP(...) with empty cell result => displays empty (MS-Excel: displays 0)				20181231 09:50:43
