helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109B2				0	id	Fit print range(s) to width/height				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109B5				0	id	Specifies the maximum number of pages horizontally (width) and vertically (height) on which every sheet with the current Page Style is to be printed. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109BB				0	id	The print ranges are always scaled proportionally, so the resulting number of pages may be less than specified.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109BF				0	id	You may clear one of the boxes, then the unspecified dimension will use as many pages as necessary.				20181231 09:50:43
