helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	id	Select the area containing all the ranges that you want to name. Then choose \<emph\>Insert - Names - Create\</emph\>. This opens the \<emph\>Create Names\</emph\> dialog, from which you can select the naming options that you want.				20181231 09:50:43
