helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_days.xhp	0	help	par_id3155139				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_TAGE\"\>Calculates the difference between two date values.\</ahelp\> The result returns the number of days between the two days.				20181231 09:50:43
