helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3148728				0	id	To calculate the intercept, use cells D3:D9 as the y value and C3:C9 as the x value from the example spreadsheet. Input will be as follows:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3149013	11			0	id	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=INTERCEPT(D3:D9;C3:C9)\</item\> = 2.15.				20181231 09:50:43
