helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3148875	36			0	id	            \<emph\>SP\</emph\> is the probability of success on each trial.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3145352	37			0	id	            \<emph\>T1\</emph\> defines the lower limit for the number of trials.				20181231 09:50:43
