helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3149481	104			0	id	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=CHITEST(A1:A6;B1:B6)\</item\> equals 0.02. This is the probability which suffices the observed data of the theoretical Chi-square distribution.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148690				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi CHIDIST\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148690				0	id	CHIDIST				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3156338				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_CHIVERT\"\>Returns the probability value from the indicated Chi square that a hypothesis is confirmed.\</ahelp\> CHIDIST compares the Chi square value to be given for a random sample that is calculated from the sum of (observed value-expected value)^2/expected value for all values with the theoretical Chi square distribution and determines from this the probability of error for the hypothesis to be tested.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3151316				0	id	The probability determined by CHIDIST can also be determined by CHITEST.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155123				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3158439				0	id	CHIDIST(Number; DegreesFreedom)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3148675	110			0	id	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the chi-square value of the random sample used to determine the error probability.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3155615	111			0	id	            \<emph\>DegreesFreedom\</emph\> are the degrees of freedom of the experiment.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146787				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3145774	113			0	id	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=CHIDIST(13.27; 5)\</item\> equals 0.02.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3156141				0	id	If the Chi square value of the random sample is 13.27 and if the experiment has 5 degrees of freedom, then the hypothesis is assured with a probability of error of 2%.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	bm_id0119200902231887				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi LOG10\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>logaritma basis 10\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	hd_id0119200901583452				0	id	CHIDIST				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id0119200901583471				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Returns the value of the probability density function or the cumulative distribution function for the chi-square distribution.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	hd_id0119200902395520				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id0119200902395679				0	id	CHISQDIST(Number; Degrees Of Freedom; Cumulative)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id011920090239564				0	id	            \<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the number for which the function is to be calculated.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id0119200902395660				0	id	            \<emph\>Degrees Of Freedom\</emph\> is the degrees of freedom for the chi-square function.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id0119200902395623				0	id	            \<emph\>Cumulative\</emph\> (optional): 0 or False calculates the probability density function. Other values or True or omitted calculates the cumulative distribution function.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150603				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi COMBIN\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>banyaknya kombinasi\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
