helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3154663	119			0	id	\<emph\>Nilai\</emph\> adalah nilai yang akan diperiksa.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3154569	120			0	id	            \<emph\>Lambda\</emph\> is the parameter value.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3147332	121			0	id	            \<emph\>C\</emph\> is a logical value that determines the form of the function. \<emph\>C = 0\</emph\> calculates the density function, and \<emph\>C = 1\</emph\> calculates the distribution.				20181231 09:50:43
