helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145271				0	id	\<variable id=\"funktionsautopilottext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FunctionDialog\"\>Opens the \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\>, which helps you to interactively create formulas.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Before you start the Wizard, select a cell or a range of cells from the current sheet, in order to determine the position at which the formula will be inserted.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id8007446				0	id	You can download the complete ODFF (OpenDocument Format Formula) specification from the \<link href=\"http://www.oasis-open.org/committees/documents.php?wg_abbrev=office-formula\"\>OASIS\</link\> web site.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159153				0	id	The \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\> has two tabs: \<emph\>Functions\</emph\> is used to create formulas, and \<emph\>Structure\</emph\> is used to check the formula build.				20181231 09:50:43
