helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147402				0	id	Menutup dialog tanpa menerapkan rumus yang telah dibuat.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150534				0	id	Oke				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153029				0	id	Ends the \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\>, and transfers the formula to the selected cells.				20181231 09:50:43
