helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147610				0	id	Tab Struktur				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153122				0	id	Di halaman ini, Anda dapat menampilkan struktur fungsi.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149350				0	id	If you start the \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\> while the cell cursor is positioned in a cell that already contains a function, the \<emph\>Structure\</emph\> tab is opened and shows the composition of the current formula.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149014				0	id	Struktur				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150481				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_FAP_STRUCT\"\>Displays a hierarchical representation of the current function.\</ahelp\> You can hide or show the arguments by a click on the plus or minus sign in front.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148886				0	id	Blue dots denote correctly entered arguments. Red dots indicate incorrect data types. For example: if the SUM function has one argument entered as text, this is highlighted in red as SUM only permits number entries.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Fungsi Statistika Bagian Empat				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153415				0	id	\<variable id=\"mq\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060184.xhp\" name=\"Fungsi Statistika Bagian Empat\"\>Fungsi Statistika Bagian Empat\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154511				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi MAX\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154511				0	id	MAX				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3153709				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MAX\"\>Returns the maximum value in a list of arguments.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id9282509				0	id	Returns 0 if no numeric value and no error was encountered in the cell range(s) passed as cell reference(s). Text cells are ignored by MIN() and MAX(). The functions MINA() and MAXA() return 0 if no value (numeric or text) and no error was encountered. Passing a literal string argument to MIN() or MAX(), e.g. MIN("string"), still results in an error.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154256				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3147340				0	id	MAX(Number1; Number2; ...Number30)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3149568	6			0	id	\<emph\>Number1; Number2;...Number30\</emph\> are numerical values or ranges. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153963				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3147343				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MAX(A1;A2;A3;50;100;200)\</item\> returns the largest value from the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3148485				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MAX(A1:B100)\</item\> returns the largest value from the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3166426				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi MAXA\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
