helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153820				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi MEDIAN\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153820				0	id	MEDIAN				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3151241				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MEDIAN\"\>Returns the median of a set of numbers. In a set containing an uneven number of values, the median will be the number in the middle of the set and in a set containing an even number of values, it will be the mean of the two values in the middle of the set.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148871				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3155264				0	id	MEDIAN(Number1; Number2; ...Number30)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150109				0	id	\<emph\>Number1; Number2;...Number30\</emph\> are values or ranges, which represent a sample. Each number can also be replaced by a reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144506				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3145078				0	id	for an odd number: \<item type=\"input\"\>=MEDIAN(1;5;9;20;21)\</item\> returns 9 as the median value.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3149126				0	id	for an even number: \<item type=\"input\"\>=MEDIAN(1;5;9;20)\</item\> returns the average of the two middle values 5 and 9, thus 7.				20181231 09:50:43
