helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3153054				0	id	\<emph\>Kelas\</emph\> mewakili susunan dari batas nilai.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3154212				0	id	\<emph\>Alpha\</emph\> represents the percentage of the scale between 0 and 1.				20181231 09:50:43
