helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3149163				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=PERCENTRANK(A1:A50;50)\</item\> returns the percentage rank of the value 50 from the total range of all values found in A1:A50. If 50 falls outside the total range, an error message will appear.				20181231 09:50:43
