helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150475				0	id	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the periodic interest rate.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153921				0	id	\<emph\>NPer\</emph\> is the payment period with the total number of periods. NPER can also be a non-integer value.				20181231 09:50:43
