helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3147478	277			0	id	What are the interest payments at a yearly interest rate of 5.5 %, a payment period of monthly payments for 2 years and a current cash value of 5,000 currency units? The start period is the 4th and the end period is the 6th period. The payment is due at the beginning of each period.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149819				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=CUMIPMT(5.5%/12;24;5000;4;6;1)\</item\> = -57.54 currency units. The interest payments for between the 4th and 6th period are 57.54 currency units.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3083280				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi CUMIPMT_ADD\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3083280				0	id	CUMIPMT_ADD				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3152482				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_CUMIPMT\"\>Calculates the accumulated interest for a period.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149713				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145087				0	id	CUMIPMT_ADD(Rate; NPer; PV; StartPeriod; EndPeriod; Type)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149277				0	id	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the interest rate for each period.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149270				0	id	\<emph\>NPer\</emph\> is the total number of payment periods. The rate and NPER must refer to the same unit, and thus both be calculated annually or monthly.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3152967				0	id	\<emph\>PV\</emph\> is the current value.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156308				0	id	\<emph\>StartPeriod\</emph\> is the first payment period for the calculation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149453				0	id	\<emph\>EndPeriod\</emph\> is the last payment period for the calculation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150962				0	id	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> is the maturity of a payment at the end of each period (Type = 0) or at the start of the period (Type = 1).				20181231 09:50:43
