helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3148652				0	id	A security is purchased on 2001-01-01; the maturity date is 2006-01-01. The nominal rate of interest is 8%. The yield is 9.0%. Interest is paid half-yearly (frequency is 2). Using daily balance interest calculation (basis 3) how long is the modified duration?				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145378				0	id	=MDURATION("2001-01-01"; "2006-01-01"; 0.08; 0.09; 2; 3) returns 4.02 years.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149242				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>penghitungan; durasi\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>durasi;penghitungan\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fungsi DURATION\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149242				0	id	NPV				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145308				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_NBW\"\>Returns the present value of an investment based on a series of periodic cash flows and a discount rate. To get the net present value, subtract the cost of the project (the initial cash flow at time zero) from the returned value.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149937				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153321				0	id	NPV(Rate; Value1; Value2; ...)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150630				0	id	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the discount rate for a period.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150427				0	id	\<emph\>Value1;...\</emph\> are up to 30 values, which represent deposits or withdrawals.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153538				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154800				0	id	What is the net present value of periodic payments of 10, 20 and 30 currency units with a discount rate of 8.75%. At time zero the costs were paid as -40 currency units.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3143270				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NPV(8.75%;10;20;30)\</item\> = 49.43 currency units. The net present value is the returned value minus the initial costs of 40 currency units, therefore 9.43 currency units.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149484				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>penghitungan; durasi\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>durasi;penghitungan\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>fungsi DURATION\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149484				0	id	NOMINAL				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3149596				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_NOMINAL\"\>Calculates the yearly nominal interest rate, given the effective rate and the number of compounding periods per year.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151252				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3152769				0	id	NOMINAL(EffectiveRate; NPerY)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3147521				0	id	\<emph\>EffectiveRate\</emph\> is the effective interest rate				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156334				0	id	\<emph\>NPerY\</emph\> is the number of periodic interest payments per year.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154473				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3147091				0	id	What is the nominal interest per year for an effective interest rate of 13.5% if twelve payments are made per year.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154831				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NOMINAL(13.5%;12)\</item\> = 12.73%. The nominal interest rate per year is 12.73%.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155123				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi NOMINAL_ADD\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
