helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150348				0	id	DOLLARDE(FractionalDollar; Fraction)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154111				0	id	\<emph\>FractionalDollar\</emph\> is a number given as a decimal fraction.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153695				0	id	\<emph\>Fraction\</emph\> is a whole number that is used as the denominator of the decimal fraction.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150941				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DOLLARDE(1.02;16)\</item\> stands for 1 and 2/16. This returns 1.125.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150830				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DOLLARDE(1.1;8)\</item\> stands for 1 and 1/8. This returns 1.125.				20181231 09:50:43
