helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154526				0	id	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153266				0	id	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3151284				0	id	\<emph\>Rate\</emph\> is the annual rate of interest.				20181231 09:50:43
