helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968	4			0	id	Select the table or the area in the table that you want to calculate subtotals for, and then choose \<emph\>Data – Subtotals\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
