helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3155834	98			0	id	\<emph\>Kelas\</emph\> mewakili susunan dari batas nilai.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3156304	99			0	id	            \<emph\>Alpha\</emph\> is the percentage of the marginal data that will not be taken into consideration.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151180				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3156130	101			0	id	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=TRIMMEAN(A1:A50; 0.1)\</item\> calculates the mean value of numbers in A1:A50, without taking into consideration the 5 percent of the values representing the highest values and the 5 percent of the values representing the lowest ones. The percentage numbers refer to the amount of the untrimmed mean value, not to the number of summands.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153216				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi FTEST\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
