helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3156109	107			0	id	            \<emph\>Data\</emph\> is the given sample, drawn from a normally distributed population.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3149977	108			0	id	            \<emph\>mu\</emph\> is the known mean of the population.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3154740	109			0	id	            \<emph\>Sigma\</emph\> (optional) is the known standard deviation of the population. If omitted, the standard deviation of the given sample is used.				20181231 09:50:43
