helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155961				0	id	Pemformatan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153965				0	id	In this section you can select or deselect the available formatting options. If you want to keep any of the settings currently in your spreadsheet, deselect the corresponding option.				20181231 09:50:43
