helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090102.xhp	0	help	par_id3155961				0	id	If the selected area contains data, the pivot table overwrites the data. To prevent the loss of existing data, let the pivot table automatically select the area to display the results.				20181231 09:50:43
