helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3691824				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi INFO\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id5787224				0	id	INFO				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id1507309				0	id	Returns specific information about the current working environment. The function receives a single text argument and returns data depending on that parameter.				20181231 09:50:43
