helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id5206762				0	id	The following table lists the values for the text parameter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Type\</item\> and the return values of the INFO function.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id5735953				0	id	Value for "Type"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id8360850				0	id	Nilai hasil				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id9648731				0	id	"osversion"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id908841				0	id	Always "Windows (32-bit) NT 5.01", for compatibility reasons				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id8193914				0	id	"system"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id9841608				0	id	The type of the operating system. \<br/\>"WNT" for Microsoft Windows \<br/\>"LINUX" for Linux \<br/\>"SOLARIS" for Solaris				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id2701803				0	id	"release"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id2136295				0	id	The product release identifier, for example "300m25(Build:9876)"				20181231 09:50:43
