helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id1491134				0	id	Current formula recalculation mode, either "Automatic" or "Manual" (localized into %PRODUCTNAME language)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id1161534				0	id	Other spreadsheet applications may accept localized values for the \<item type=\"literal\"\>Type\</item\> parameter, but %PRODUCTNAME Calc will only accept the English values.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id5459456				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3994567				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=INFO("release")\</item\> returns the product release number of the %PRODUCTNAME in use.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id2873622				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=INFO(D5)\</item\> with cell \<item type=\"literal\"\>D5\</item\> containing a text string \<item type=\"literal\"\>system\</item\> returns the operation system type.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155625				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi CURRENT\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155625				0	id	CURRENT				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3157975				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_AKTUELL\"\>This function returns the result to date of evaluating the formula of which it is a part (in other words the result as far as that evaluation has got). Its main use is together with the STYLE() function to apply selected styles to a cell depending on the cell contents.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148880				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3150930				0	id	CURRENT()				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145629				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id5919064				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=1+2+CURRENT()\</item\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id8751792				0	id	The example returns 6. The formula is calculated from left to right as: 1 + 2 equals 3, giving the result to date when CURRENT() is encountered; CURRENT() therefore yields 3, which is added to the original 3 to give 6.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id5863826				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=A2+B2+STYLE(IF(CURRENT()>10;”Red”;”Default”))\</item\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id7463911				0	id	The example returns A2 + B2 (STYLE returns 0 here). If this sum is greater than 10, the style Red is applied to the cell. See the \<emph\>STYLE\</emph\> function for more explanation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id7318643				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>="choo"&CURRENT()\</item\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id6019165				0	id	The example returns choochoo.				20181231 09:50:43
