helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153923				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FORMULA(A8)\</item\> returns the text =SUM(1;2;3).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155409				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>ISREF function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>references;testing cell contents\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cell contents;testing for references\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
