helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153723				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ISTBEZUG\"\>Tests if the argument is a reference.\</ahelp\> Returns TRUE if the argument is a reference, returns FALSE otherwise. When given a reference this function does not examine the value being referenced.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147175				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3149821				0	id	ISREF(nilai)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3146152				0	id	\<emph\>Value\</emph\> is the value to be tested, to determine whether it is a reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	hd_id3083448				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154317				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISREF(C5)\</item\> returns the result TRUE because C5 is a valid reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id9728072				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISREF("abcdef")\</item\> returns always FALSE because a text can never be a reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id2131544				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISREF(4)\</item\> returns FALSE.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id4295480				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISREF(INDIRECT("A6"))\</item\> returns TRUE, because INDIRECT is a function that returns a reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id3626819				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ISREF(ADDRESS(1; 1; 2;"Sheet2"))\</item\> returns FALSE, because ADDRESS is a function that returns a text, although it looks like a reference.				20181231 09:50:43
