helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3157849				0	id	\<emph\>Array\</emph\> represents a square array that is to be inverted.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN113EE				0	id	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#moreontop\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157868				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3149638				0	id	Select a square range and select MINVERSE. Select the output array, select the \<emph\>Array\</emph\> field and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148546				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi MMULT\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148546				0	id	MMULT				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3148518				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MMULT\"\>Calculates the array product of two arrays.\</ahelp\> The number of columns for array 1 must match the number of rows for array 2. The square array has an equal number of rows and columns.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146767				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3150798				0	id	MMULT(susunan; susunan)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3150812				0	id	\<emph\>Array\</emph\> at first place represents the first array used in the array product.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3152553				0	id	\<emph\>Array\</emph\> at second place represents the second array with the same number of rows.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN114C3				0	id	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#moreontop\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152574				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3146826				0	id	Select a square range. Choose the MMULT function. Select the first \<emph\>Array\</emph\>, then select the second \<emph\>Array\</emph\>. Using \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\>, mark the \<emph\>Array\</emph\> check box. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The output array will appear in the first selected range.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154970				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi TRANSPOSE\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154970				0	id	TRANSPOSE				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3155276				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MTRANS\"\>Transposes the rows and columns of an array.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155294				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3153843				0	id	TRANSPOSE(susunan)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3153857				0	id	\<emph\>Array\</emph\> represents the array in the spreadsheet that is to be transposed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN115A5				0	id	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#moreontop\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159352				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3159366				0	id	In the spreadsheet, select the range in which the transposed array can appear. If the original array has n rows and m columns, your selected range must have at least m rows and n columns. Then enter the formula directly, select the original array and press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Shift+Command+Enter\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Shift+Ctrl+Enter\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>. Or, if you are using the \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\>, mark the \<emph\>Array\</emph\> check box. The transposed array appears in the selected target range and is protected automatically against changes.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	bm_id3109846				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi LINEST\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3109846				0	id	LINEST				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3144733				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_RGP\"\>Returns a table of statistics for a straight line that best fits a data set.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152825				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3152839				0	id	LINEST(Data_Y; Data_X; Jenis_Linear; Status)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3152853				0	id	\<emph\>data_Y\</emph\> is a single row or column range specifying the y coordinates in a set of data points.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154428				0	id	\<emph\>data_X\</emph\> is a corresponding single row or column range specifying the x coordinates. If \<emph\>data_X\</emph\> is omitted it defaults to \<item type=\"literal\"\>1, 2, 3, ..., n\</item\>. If there is more than one set of variables \<emph\>data_X\</emph\> may be a range with corresponding multiple rows or columns.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id0811200804502119				0	id	LINEST finds a straight line \<item type=\"literal\"\>y = a + bx\</item\> that best fits the data, using linear regression (the "least squares" method). With more than one set of variables the straight line is of the form \<item type=\"literal\"\>y = a + b1x1 + b2x2 ... + bnxn\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154448				0	id	 if\<emph\>linearType\</emph\> is FALSE the straight line found is forced to pass through the origin (the constant a is zero; y = bx). If omitted, \<emph\>linearType\</emph\> defaults to TRUE (the line is not forced through the origin).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154142				0	id	if\<emph\>stats\</emph\> is omitted or FALSE only the top line of the statistics table is returned. If TRUE the entire table is returned.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id0811200804502261				0	id	LINEST returns a table (array) of statistics as below and must be entered as an array formula (for example by using \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Return rather than just Return).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN11416				0	id	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#optional\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN116C6				0	id	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#moreontop\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154162				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154176				0	id	This function returns an array and is handled in the same way as the other array functions. Select a range for the answers and then the function. Select \<emph\>data_Y\</emph\>. If you want, you can enter other parameters. Select \<emph\>Array\</emph\> and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3155468				0	id	The results returned by the system (if \<emph\>stats\</emph\> = 0), will at least show the slope of the regression line and its intersection with the Y axis. If \<emph\>stats\</emph\> does not equal 0, other results are to be displayed.				20181231 09:50:43
