helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3144687				0	id	Column A contains several X1 values, column B several X2 values and column C the Y values. You have already entered these values in your spreadsheet. You have now set up E2:G6 in the spreadsheet and activated the \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\>. For the LINEST function to work, you must have marked the \<emph\>Array\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\>. Next, select the following values in the spreadsheet (or enter them using the keyboard):				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3158020				0	id	\<emph\>Data_Y\</emph\> adalah C2:C8				20181231 09:50:43
