helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3155991				0	id	\<emph\>StDev\</emph\> (optional) is the standard deviation of the standard logarithmic distribution.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060183.xhp	0	help	par_id3155992				0	id	\<emph\>Cumulative\</emph\> (optional) = 0 calculates the density function, Cumulative = 1 calculates the distribution.				20181231 09:50:43
