helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154948				0	id	 This function returns the inverse trigonometric cotangent of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, that is the angle (in radians) whose cotangent is Number. The angle returned is between 0 and PI.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5834528				0	id	To return the angle in degrees, use the DEGREES function.				20181231 09:50:43
