helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8589434				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DEGREES(ACOT(1))\</item\> returns 45. The tangent of 45 degrees is 1. 				20181231 09:50:43
