helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3153866				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=LN(3)\</item\> returns the natural logarithm of 3 (approximately 1.0986).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5747245				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=LN(EXP(321))\</item\> returns 321.				20181231 09:50:43
