helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144732				0	id	LOG(Number; Base)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144746				0	id	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the value whose logarithm is to be calculated.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152840				0	id	\<emph\>Base\</emph\> (optional) is the base for the logarithm calculation. If omitted, Base 10 is assumed.				20181231 09:50:43
