helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154429				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=LOG(10;3)\</item\> returns the logarithm to base 3 of 10 (approximately 2.0959).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5577562				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=LOG(7^4;7)\</item\> returns 4.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154187				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi LOG10\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>logaritma basis 10\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
