helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3160449				0	id	If you enter the numbers \<item type=\"input\"\>2\</item\>; \<item type=\"input\"\>3\</item\> and \<item type=\"input\"\>4\</item\> in the Number 1; 2 and 3 text boxes, 29 is returned as the result.				20181231 09:50:43
