helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id7985168				0	id	QUOTIENT is equivalent to \<item type=\"literal\"\>INT(numerator/denominator)\</item\>, except that it may report errors with different error codes.				20181231 09:50:43
