helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3158182				0	id	ROUND(Number; Count)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3158196				0	id	Returns \<emph\>Number\</emph\> rounded to \<emph\>Count\</emph\> decimal places. If Count is omitted or zero, the function rounds to the nearest integer. If Count is negative, the function rounds to the nearest 10, 100, 1000, etc.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id599688				0	id	This function rounds to the nearest number. See ROUNDDOWN and ROUNDUP for alternatives.				20181231 09:50:43
