helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164288				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_MROUND\"\>Returns a number rounded to the nearest multiple of another number.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164306				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164320				0	id	MROUND(Angka; Perkalian)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3486434				0	id	Returns \<emph\>Number\</emph\> rounded to the nearest multiple of \<emph\>Multiple\</emph\>. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3068636				0	id	An alternative implementation would be \<item type=\"literal\"\>Multiple * ROUND(Number/Multiple)\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164333				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164347				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MROUND(15.5;3)\</item\> returns 15, as 15.5 is closer to 15 (= 3*5) than to 18 (= 3*6).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_idN14DD6				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MROUND(1.4;0.5)\</item\> returns 1.5 (= 0.5*3).				20181231 09:50:43
