helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id1501510				0	id	Returns the positive square root of (PI multiplied by \<emph\>Number\</emph\>).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id9929197				0	id	This is equivalent to \<item type=\"literal\"\>SQRT(PI()*Number)\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
