helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164711				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_RANDBETWEEN\"\>Returns an integer random number in a specified range.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164745				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164758				0	id	RANDBETWEEN(Bawah; Atas)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id7112338				0	id	Returns an integer random number between integers \<emph\>Bottom\</emph\> and \<emph\>Top\</emph\> (both inclusive).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id2855616				0	id	This function produces a new random number each time Calc recalculates. To force Calc to recalculate manually press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F9.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id2091433				0	id	To generate random numbers which never recalculate, copy cells containing this function, and use \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit - Paste Special\</item\> (with \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Paste All\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formulas\</item\> not marked and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbers\</item\> marked).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164772				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164785				0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=RANDBETWEEN(20;30)\</item\> returns an integer of between 20 and 30.				20181231 09:50:43
