helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3146920	373			0	id	            \<emph\>Cost\</emph\> means the acquisition costs.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3163807	374			0	id	            \<emph\>DatePurchased\</emph\> is the date of acquisition.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488	375			0	id	            \<emph\>FirstPeriod \</emph\>is the end date of the first settlement period.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149530	376			0	id	            \<emph\>Salvage\</emph\> is the salvage value of the capital asset at the end of the depreciable life.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148633	377			0	id	            \<emph\>Period\</emph\> is the settlement period to be considered.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150982	378			0	id	\<emph\>Nilai\</emph\> adalah nilai yang akan diperiksa.				20181231 09:50:43
