helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3156124				0	id	This formula is duplicated in column E down to E11 (select E2, then drag down the lower right corner with the mouse).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147270				0	id	Cell E13 contains the formula used to check the total of the depreciation amounts. It uses the SUMIF function as the negative values in E8:E11 must not be considered. The condition >0 is contained in cell A13. The formula in E13 is as follows:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3152811	85			0	id	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=SUMIF(E2:E11;A13)\</item\>         				20181231 09:50:43
