helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id6695455				0	id	BAHTTEXT				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id354014				0	id	Converts a number to Thai text, including the Thai currency names.				20181231 09:50:43
