helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149150				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ZEICHEN\"\>Converts a number into a character according to the current code table.\</ahelp\> The number can be a two-digit or three-digit integer number.				20181231 09:50:43
