helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149890	208			0	id	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=CHAR(100)\</item\> returns the character d.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id0907200910283297				0	id	="abc" & CHAR(10) & "def" inserts a newline character into the string.				20181231 09:50:43
