helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3152770				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_CODE\"\>Returns a numeric code for the first character in a text string.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
