helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3149188				0	id	CODE("Text")				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154383	7			0	id	            \<emph\>Text\</emph\> is the text for which the code of the first character is to be found.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154394				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3159209	9			0	id	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=CODE("Hieronymus")\</item\> returns 72, \<item type=\"input\"\>=CODE("hieroglyphic")\</item\> returns 104.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150280				0	id	The code used here does not refer to ASCII, but to the code table currently loaded.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149688				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi CONCATENATE\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
