helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154524				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_VERKETTEN\"\>Combines several text strings into one string.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
