helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152589				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi FIND\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152589				0	id	FIND				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3146149				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_FINDEN\"\>Looks for a string of text within another string.\</ahelp\> You can also define where to begin the search. The search term can be a number or any string of characters. The search is case-sensitive.				20181231 09:50:43
