helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150608	48			0	id	\<emph\>Nilai\</emph\> adalah nilai yang akan diperiksa.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3152374	49			0	id	            \<emph\>Text\</emph\> is the text where the search takes place.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3152475	50			0	id	            \<emph\>Position\</emph\> (optional) is the position in the text from which the search starts.				20181231 09:50:43
