helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149268				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi FIXED\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149268				0	id	FIXED				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3155833				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_FEST\"\>Returns a number as text with a specified number of decimal places and optional thousands separators.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152470				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3147567				0	id	FIXED(Number; Decimals; NoThousandsSeparators)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3151272	38			0	id	\<emph\>Nilai\</emph\> adalah nilai yang akan diperiksa.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156322	39			0	id	            \<emph\>Decimals\</emph\> refers to the number of decimal places to be displayed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150877	40			0	id	            \<emph\>NoThousandsSeparators\</emph\> (optional) determines whether the thousands separator is used. If the parameter is a number not equal to 0, the thousands separator is suppressed. If the parameter is equal to 0 or if it is missing altogether, the thousands separators of your \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01140000.xhp\" name=\"current locale setting\"\>current locale setting\</link\> are displayed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149040				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145208	42			0	id	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=FIXED(1234567.89;3)\</item\> returns 1,234,567.890 as a text string. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id5282143				0	id	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=FIXED(1234567.89;3;1)\</item\> returns 1234567.890 as a text string.				20181231 09:50:43
