helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknumadd.xhp	0	help	par_id3159277				0	id	\<emph\>Date\</emph\> is the date within the calendar week.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknumadd.xhp	0	help	par_id3154098				0	id	\<emph\>ReturnType\</emph\> is 1 for week beginning on a Sunday, 2 for week beginning on a Monday.				20181231 09:50:43
