helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148768				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>calculating;variable declining depreciations\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>depreciations;variable declining\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>VDB function\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
