helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3154212				0	id	For four periods (years) and a cash value of 7,500 currency units, the interest rate of the return is to be calculated if the future value is 10,000 currency units.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3150775	246			0	id	\<item type=\"input\"\>=RRI(4;7500;10000)\</item\> = 7.46 %				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3145413	247			0	id	The interest rate must be 7.46 % so that 7,500 currency units will become 10,000 currency units.				20181231 09:50:43
