helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148910				0	id	\<emph\>NPer\</emph\> is the total number of periods, during which payments are made (payment period).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148925				0	id	\<emph\>Pmt\</emph\> is the constant payment (annuity) paid during each period.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3149160				0	id	\<emph\>PV\</emph\> is the cash value in the sequence of payments.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3166456				0	id	\<emph\>FV\</emph\> (optional) is the future value, which is reached at the end of the periodic payments.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153243				0	id	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> (optional) is the due date of the periodic payment, either at the beginning or at the end of a period.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3146949				0	id	\<emph\>Guess\</emph\> (optional) determines the estimated value of the interest with iterative calculation.				20181231 09:50:43
