helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148618				0	id	\<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3148988				0	id	\<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security is sold.				20181231 09:50:43
