helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3148656	148			0	id	            \<emph\>Count1\</emph\> is the total number of objects.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3150826	149			0	id	            \<emph\>Count2\</emph\> is the number of objects in each permutation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153351				0	id	Contoh				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3150424	151			0	id	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=PERMUT(6;3)\</item\> returns 120. There are 120 different possibilities, to pick a sequence of 3 playing cards out of 6 playing cards.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143276				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi PERMUTATIONA\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143276				0	id	PERMUTATIONA				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3144759				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_VARIATIONEN2\"\>Returns the number of permutations for a given number of objects (repetition allowed).\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145598				0	id	Sintaksis				20181231 09:50:43
