helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3146148				0	id	Jika A=TRUE dan B=FALSE contoh berikut akan muncul:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3083285	44			0	id	           \<item type=\"input\"\>=AND(A;B)\</item\> returns FALSE				20181231 09:50:43
