helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150867	57			0	id	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=IF(A1>5;100;"too small")\</item\> If the value in A1 is higher than 5, the value 100 is entered in the current cell; otherwise, the text “too small” (without quotes) is entered.				20181231 09:50:43
