helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155819	24			0	id	            \<emph\>LogicalValue1; LogicalValue2 ...LogicalValue30\</emph\> are conditions to be checked. All conditions can be either TRUE or FALSE. If a range is entered as a parameter, the function uses the value from the range that is in the current column or row.				20181231 09:50:43
