helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060K				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ODER\"\>Returns the exclusive "or" of arguments.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771K				0	id	The arguments are either numbers, logical expressions themselves (TRUE, 1<5, 2+3=7, B8<10) that return logical values, or arrays (A1:C3).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149027K				0	id	If the entered range is outside of the current column or row of the formula, the function returns the error value #VALUE!				20181231 09:50:43
