helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154138				0	id	You can also start a macro with an error message. A sample macro is provided at the end of this page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156280				0	id	Menampilkan pesan kesalahan apabila memasukkan data tak sah.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150768				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the error message that you enter in the \<emph\>Contents\</emph\> area when invalid data is entered in a cell.\</ahelp\> If enabled, the message is displayed to prevent an invalid entry.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146984	5			0	id	In both cases, if you select "Stop", the invalid entry is deleted and the previous value is reentered in the cell. The same applies if you close the "Warning" and "Information" dialogs by clicking the \<emph\>Cancel \</emph\>button. If you close the dialogs with the \<emph\>OK\</emph\> button, the invalid entry is not deleted.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152460				0	id	Isi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148646				0	id	Aksi 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151115				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:TP_VALIDATION_ERROR:LB_ACTION\"\>Select the action that you want to occur when invalid data is entered in a cell.\</ahelp\> The "Stop" action rejects the invalid entry and displays a dialog that you have to close by clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The "Warning" and "Information" actions display a dialog that can be closed by clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\> or \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\>. The invalid entry is only rejected when you click \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156441				0	id	Telusur				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153160				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:TP_VALIDATION_ERROR:BTN_SEARCH\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06130000.xhp\" name=\"Macro\"\>Macro\</link\> dialog where you can select the macro that is executed when invalid data is entered in a cell. The macro is executed after the error message is displayed.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
