helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3154766				0	id	You can edit the individual objects of a group by selecting the group and pressing F3. Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F3 to exit the group editing mode.				20181231 09:50:43
