helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3156286				0	id	You can replace colors in bitmaps with the \<emph\>Color Replacer\</emph\> tool.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3154704				0	id	Hingga empat warna bisa diganti dalam satu waktu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3147344				0	id	Anda juga bisa memakai pilihan \<emph\>Transparansi\</emph\> untuk mengganti wilayah tembus pandang sebuah wilayah citra dengan sebuah warna.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	id	Similarly, you can use the \<emph\>Color Replacer\</emph\> to make a color on your image transparent.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150205				0	id	To replace colors with the Color Replacer tool				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3154656				0	id	Pastikan bawah citra yang Anda gunakan adalah bitmap (sebagai cintoh, BMP, GIF, JPG, atau PNG) atau berkas meta (contohnya WMF).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3150202				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Color Replacer\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3155531				0	id	Click the Color Replacer icon and position the mouse pointer over the color you want to replace in the image. The color appears in the box next to the icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3152985				0	id	Klik warna citra tersebut. Warnanya akan muncul di kotak pertama \<emph\>Warna sumber\</emph\> dan kotak cek di sebelah warna itu akan terpilih.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3148866				0	id	Pada kotak \<emph\>Ganti dengan\</emph\>, pilih warna baru.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3145362				0	id	Ini akan mengganti seluruh \<emph\>Warna sumber\</emph\> di dalam citra.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3151191				0	id	Apabila Anda hendak mengganti warna lainnya sembari dialog itu terbuka, pilih kotak cek di depan \<emph\>Warna sumber\</emph\> di baris selanjutnya dan ulangi langkah 3 sampai 5.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3149876				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Ganti\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3157871				0	id	If you want to expand or contract the color selection area, increase or decrease the tolerance of the \<emph\>Color Replacer\</emph\> tool and repeat your selection.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\eyedropper.xhp	0	help	par_id3146878				0	id	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06030000.xhp\" name=\"Color Replacer\"\>Color Replacer\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
