helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\02\19020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148768				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"FN_INSERT_FOOTER\"\>Menampilkan footer dokumen HTML jika tampilan footer di-enable pada tab \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05040400.xhp\" name=\"Format - Page - Footer\"\>\<emph\>Format - Halaman - Footer\</emph\>\</link\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
