helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3153167				0	id	If you want, you can use a condition to hide specific text in your document from a specific user.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3153190				0	id	Select the text in the document that you want to hide.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3145273				0	id	Pilih \<emph\>Sisip - Seksi\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3145297				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Hide\</item\> area, select the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Hide\</item\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3155533	105			0	id	In the \<emph\>With Condition\</emph\> box, type \<emph\>user_lastname == "Doe"\</emph\>, where "Doe" is the last name of the user that you want to hide the text from. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_userdata.xhp	0	help	par_id3155573				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Sisip\</emph\> lalu simpan dokumennya.				20181231 09:50:43
