helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155624				0	id	\<variable id=\"footer_pagenumber\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/footer_pagenumber.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Page Numbers in Footers\"\>Inserting Page Numbers in Footers\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id8230842				0	id	You can easily insert a page number field in the footer of your document. You can also add a page count to the footer, for example, in the form "Page 9 of 12"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	hd_id7867366				0	id	To Insert a Page Number				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3150508				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Footer\</emph\> and select the page style that you want to add the footer to.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3150534				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Page Number\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3153155				0	id	If you want, you can align the page number field as you would text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	hd_id2988677				0	id	To Additionally Add a Page Count				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3155532				0	id	Click in front of the page number field, type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Page\</item\> and enter a space; click after the field, enter a space and then type \<item type=\"literal\"\>of\</item\> and enter another space.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3155554				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Page Count\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
