helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_date_conv.xhp	0	help	par_id3155919				0	id	Right-click in a table cell and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Number recognition\</item\>. When this feature is on, a check mark is displayed in front of the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Number recognition\</item\> command.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_date_conv.xhp	0	help	par_id3155527				0	id	Choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Table\</item\>, and select or clear the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Number recognition\</item\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
