helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3145715				0	id	When you insert an object, graphic, or frame, an anchor icon appears where the item is anchored. You can position an anchored item by dragging the item to another location. To change the anchoring options of an item, right-click the item, and then choose an option from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Anchor\</item\> submenu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_repeat_multiple_headers.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Repeating a Table Header on a New Page				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_repeat_multiple_headers.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155870				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>tables; heading repetition after page breaks\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>repeating; table headings after page breaks\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>headings; repeating in tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>multi-page tables\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_repeat_multiple_headers.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153406				0	id	\<variable id=\"table_repeat_multiple_headers\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/table_repeat_multiple_headers.xhp\" name=\"Repeating a Table Header on a New Page\"\>Repeating a Table Heading on a New Page\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_repeat_multiple_headers.xhp	0	help	par_id3149636				0	id	You can repeat a table heading on each new page that the table spans.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_repeat_multiple_headers.xhp	0	help	par_id3145098				0	id	Pilih \<emph\>Tabel - Sisip - Tabel\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_repeat_multiple_headers.xhp	0	help	par_id3156240				0	id	Select the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Heading\</item\> and the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Repeat heading\</item\> check boxes.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_repeat_multiple_headers.xhp	0	help	par_id3153376				0	id	Select the number of rows and columns for the table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_repeat_multiple_headers.xhp	0	help	par_id3153393				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Oke\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
