helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3155858				0	id	You can protect, hide, and convert sections to normal text in your document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3154224				0	id	Choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02170000.xhp\" name=\"Format - Sections\"\>\<emph\>Format - Sections\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149848				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Section\</item\> list, click the section you want to modify. You can press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+A to select all sections in the list, and you can Shift+click or \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+click to select some sections.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3153397				0	id	Lakukan satu dari langkah-langkah berikut:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3153120				0	id	To convert a section into normal text, click \<emph\>Remove\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149631				0	id	To make a section read-only, select the \<emph\>Protected\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Write Protection\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3149609				0	id	To hide a section, select the \<emph\>Hide\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Hide\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
