helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3153140				0	id	You can resize the width of table cells and columns, as well as change the height of table rows.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3149615				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id3149622\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_optimizetable.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149622\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3146497				0	id	You can also distribute rows and columns evenly using the icons on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Optimize\</item\> toolbar on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Table\</item\> Bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145109				0	id	Mengubah Lebar Kolom dan Sel				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149574				0	id	Untuk mengubah lebar kolom:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3149587				0	id	Do one of the following:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3156246				0	id	Rest the mouse pointer over the column dividing line until the pointer becomes a separator icon, and then drag the line to a new location.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3145390				0	id	Rest the mouse pointer over the column dividing line on the ruler until the pointer becomes a separator icon, and then drag the line to a new location.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id0918200811260957				0	id	Hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and then click and drag a line to scale all cells right or above the line proportionally.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3145411				0	id	Place the cursor in a cell in the column, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key, and then press the left or the right arrow key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3153364				0	id	To increase the distance from the left edge of the page to the edge of the table, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift, and then press the right arrow key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3155891				0	id	You can specify the behavior for the arrow keys by choosing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - \</emph\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Table\</emph\>, and selecting the options that you want in the \<emph\>Keyboard handling\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149993				0	id	Untuk mengubah lebar kolom:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3148676				0	id	Hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option+Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt+Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press the left or the right arrow key				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153014				0	id	Mengubah Tinggi Baris				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3153035				0	id	To change the height of a row, place the cursor in a cell in the row, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key, and then press the up or the down arrow key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id8478041				0	id	Resizing a Whole Table				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3358867				0	id	To change the width and height of a table, do one of the following:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id5366679				0	id	Click inside the table. In the rulers, drag the border between the white and the gray area to resize the table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id1279030				0	id	Click inside the table. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Table - Table Properties\</item\> to open a dialog and set the properties to the numbers.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id5009308				0	id	To wrap text to the sides of a table, and to arrange two tables next to another, you must insert the tables into a frame. Click inside the table, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+A twice to select the whole table, then choose \<emph\>Insert - Frame\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id4190496				0	id	Tables within HTML pages do not offer the full range of properties and commands as tables in OpenDocument format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Creating and Applying Page Styles				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	bm_id7071138				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>page styles;creating and applying\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>defining;page styles\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>styles;for pages\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155182	1			0	id	\<variable id=\"pagestyles\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/pagestyles.xhp\" name=\"Creating and Applying Page Styles\"\>Creating and Applying Page Styles\</link\> \</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149846				0	id	$[officename] uses page styles to specify the layout of a page, including the page orientation, background, margins, headers, footers, and text columns. To change the layout of an individual page in a document, you must create and apply a custom page style to the page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071A				0	id	\<embedvar href=\"text/swriter/guide/pageorientation.xhp#pageorientation\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_idN10722				0	id	\<embedvar href=\"text/swriter/guide/pagebackground.xhp#pagebackground\"/\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156109				0	id	To Define a New Page Style				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153411	3			0	id	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</item\>               \<emph\>.\</emph\>            				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153133				0	id	Klik ikon \<emph\>Gaya Halaman\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149641				0	id	In the list of page styles, right-click an item, and then choose \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149614				0	id	On the \<emph\>Organizer\</emph\> tab, type a name in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3145110				0	id	Lakukan satu dari langkah-langkah berikut:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3156252				0	id	To apply the custom page style to a single page, select the default page style that is used in your document in the \<emph\>Next Style\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153376				0	id	To apply the custom page style to more than one page, select its name in the \<emph\>Next Style\</emph\> box. To stop using the style, insert a manual page break and assign it a different page style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154252				0	id	Use the tabs in the dialog to set the layout options for the page style, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154851				0	id	Untuk menerapkan gaya halaman:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154873				0	id	Click in the page that you want to apply the page style to.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3155888				0	id	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page Style\</item\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	id	Klik ganda sebuah nama pada daftar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148701				0	id	To Apply a Page Style to a New Page				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3147122				0	id	Klik pada dokumen di mana Anda hendak menambahkan teks.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150210				0	id	Pilih \<emph\>Sisip - Seksi\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150235				0	id	Select \<emph\>Page break\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150939				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> box, select the page style that you want to apply to the page that follows the manual break.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3150965				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Oke\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
