helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148856	1			0	id	\<variable id=\"hidden_text\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/hidden_text.xhp\" name=\"Hiding Text\"\>Hiding Text\</link\> \</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103				0	id	You can use fields and sections to hide or display text in your document if a condition is met.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153409				0	id	Before you can hide text, you must first create a variable to use in the condition for hiding the text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id5174108				0	id	To Create a Variable				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153131				0	id	Click in your document and choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149640	21			0	id	Click the \<emph\>Variables \</emph\>tab and click "Set Variable" in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149970	22			0	id	Click "General" in the \<emph\>Format \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149620				0	id	Type a name for the variable in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Name\</item\> box, for example, \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149869				0	id	Enter a value for the variable in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Value\</item\> box, for example, \<item type=\"literal\"\>1\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145108				0	id	To hide the variable in your document, select \<emph\>Invisible\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149585				0	id	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156245				0	id	To Hide Text				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145391				0	id	Klik pada dokumen di mana Anda hendak menambahkan teks.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145409	5			0	id	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Functions \</emph\>tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155325	29			0	id	Click "Hidden Text" in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154404				0	id	Enter a statement in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box. For example, using the variable you previously defined, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide==1\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153371	31			0	id	Type the text that you want to hide in the \<emph\>Hidden text \</emph\>box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154233				0	id	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154256				0	id	To Hide a Paragraph				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154853				0	id	Klik pada dokumen di mana Anda hendak menambahkan teks.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3154872	35			0	id	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Functions \</emph\>tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902	6			0	id	Click "Hidden Paragraph" in the \<emph\>Type \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155947				0	id	Enter a statement in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box. For example, using the variable you previously defined, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>Hide==1\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3149991				0	id	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3793450				0	id	You must enable this feature by removing the check mark from menu \<emph\>View - Hidden Paragraphs\</emph\>. When the check mark is set, you cannot hide any paragraph.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148675				0	id	To Hide a Section				20181231 09:50:43
