helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156377				0	id	\<variable id=\"table_insert\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/table_insert.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Tables\"\>Inserting Tables\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149489				0	id	There are several ways to create a table in a text document. You can insert a table from a toolbar, through a menu command, or from a spreadsheet. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155908				0	id	To Insert a Table From the Insert Toolbar				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155861				0	id	Klik pada dokumen Anda di mana Anda hendak menyisipkan indeks.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3147416				0	id	On the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Table\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153398				0	id	In the table grid, drag to select the numbers of rows and columns that you want, and then release.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153416				0	id	To cancel, drag to the other side until \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\> appears in the preview area of the grid.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153135				0	id	To Insert a Table With a Menu Command				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149642				0	id	Klik pada dokumen Anda di mana Anda hendak menyisipkan indeks.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149609	37			0	id	Pilih \<emph\>Tabel - Sisip - Tabel\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149858				0	id	In the \<emph\>Size\</emph\> area, enter the number of rows and columns.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145097				0	id	Select the options that you want, click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
