helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149594				0	id	Open the $[officename] Calc spreadsheet containing the cell range that you want to insert.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3156250				0	id	In the spreadsheet, drag to select the cells.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154395				0	id	Pilih \<emph\>Sunting - Cari & Ganti\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154420				0	id	In your text document, do one of the following:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153383				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste\</emph\>. The cell range is pasted as an OLE object. To edit the contents of the cells, double-click the object.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154248				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste Special\</emph\>, and choose from the following options:				20181231 09:50:43
