helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Inserting a Chapter Name and Number in a Header or a Footer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155919				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>running titles in headers\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>floating titles in headers\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>headers; chapter information\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>chapter names in headers\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>names; chapter names in headers\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155919				0	id	\<variable id=\"header_with_chapter\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/header_with_chapter.xhp\" name=\"Inserting a Chapter Name and Number in a Header or a Footer\"\>Inserting a Chapter Name and Number in a Header or a Footer\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414				0	id	Before you can insert chapter information into a header or footer, you must first set the outline numbering options for the paragraph style that you want to use for chapter titles.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154244				0	id	To Create a Paragraph Style for Chapter Titles				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155874				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155898				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> box, select the paragraph style that you want to use for chapter titles, for example, "Heading 1".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147124				0	id	Select the numbering style for the chapter titles in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Number\</item\> box, for example, "1,2,3...".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150219				0	id	Type "Chapter" followed by a space in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Before\</item\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150245				0	id	Enter a space in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>After\</item\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150949				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Oke\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150505				0	id	To Insert the Chapter Name and Number in a Header or a Footer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150527				0	id	Apply the paragraph style that you defined for chapter titles to the chapter headings in your document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153729				0	id	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Header\</item\> or \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Footer\</item\>, and then select the page style for the current page from the submenu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153762				0	id	Click in the header or footer.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3146863				0	id	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\> and click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Document\</item\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153175				0	id	Click "Chapter" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list and "Chapter number and name" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format\</item\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147065				0	id	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147095				0	id	The header on every page that uses the current page style automatically displays the chapter name and number.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Using Shortcut Keys ($[officename] Writer Accessibility)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151169				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>keyboard; accessibility $[officename] Writer\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>accessibility; $[officename] Writer\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151169				0	id	\<variable id=\"keyboard\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/keyboard.xhp\" name=\"Using Shortcut Keys ($[officename] Writer Accessibility)\"\>Using Shortcut Keys ($[officename] Writer Accessibility)\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149685				0	id	Press the keys \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+<underlined character> to open a menu. In an open menu, press the underlined character to run a command. For example, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+I to open the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> menu, and then T to insert a table.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155186				0	id	To open a context menu, press Shift+F10. To close a context menu, press Escape.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155918				0	id	To Insert Sections				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AA				0	id	Choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars - Insert\</emph\> to open the \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155870				0	id	Press F6 until the focus is on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149630				0	id	Press the right arrow key until the \<emph\>Section\</emph\> icon is selected.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145100				0	id	Press the down arrow key, and then press the right arrow key to set the width of the section that you want to insert.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156237				0	id	Tekan Enter.				20181231 09:50:43
