helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN10837				0	id	In the list of page styles, right-click an item, and then choose \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\pagebackground.xhp	0	help	par_idN1083F				0	id	On the \<emph\>Organizer\</emph\> tab page, type a name for the page style in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
