helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147132				0	id	The best way to generate a table of contents is to apply the predefined heading paragraph styles, such as "Heading 1", to the paragraphs that you want to include in your table of contents.				20181231 09:50:43
