helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10665				0	id	Select the whole document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10669				0	id	Pilih \<emph\>Format - Halaman - Halaman\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10671				0	id	Select the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Register-true\</item\> checkbox and click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10678				0	id	All the paragraphs in the document will be printed register-true, unless otherwise specified.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067B				0	id	To Exempt Paragraphs From Register-True Printing				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10682				0	id	Lakukan satu dari langkah-langkah berikut:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10685				0	id	Select all the paragraphs you want to exempt, then choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN1068C				0	id	Open the Styles and Formatting window, click the Paragraph Style you want to exempt, right-click that style, choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>. In the dialog, click the \<emph\>Indents & Spacing\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10698				0	id	Clear the \<emph\>Register-true\</emph\> checkbox.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AA				0	id	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030100.xhp\"\>Register-true\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Membuat Bibliografi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149687				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>indexes;creating bibliographies\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>databases;creating bibliographies\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>bibliographies\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>entries;bibliographies\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>storing bibliographic information\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149687				0	id	\<variable id=\"indices_literature\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/indices_literature.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Bibliography\"\>Creating a Bibliography\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3155864				0	id	A bibliography is a list of works that you reference in a document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153402				0	id	Menempatkan Informasi Bibliografi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153414				0	id	$[officename] stores bibliographic information in a bibliography database, or in an individual document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154244				0	id	To Store Information in the Bibliography Database				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3155872				0	id	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02250000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Bibliography Database\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Bibliography Database\</emph\>\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3155900				0	id	Pilih \<emph\>Sisip - Seksi\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147123				0	id	Type a name for the bibliography entry in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Short name\</item\> box, and then add additional information to the record in the remaining boxes.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150219	66			0	id	Close the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Bibliography Database\</item\> window. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150242				0	id	To Store Bibliographic Information in an Individual Document				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150945				0	id	Click in your document where you want to add the bibliography entry.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150964				0	id	Choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120300.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Indexes and Tables - Bibliography Entry\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Bibliography Entry\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3150525				0	id	Select \<emph\>From document content\</emph\> and click \<emph\>New\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153738				0	id	Type a name for the bibliography entry in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Short name\</item\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153763				0	id	Select the publication source for the record in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> box, and then add additional information in the remaining boxes.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3146873				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Oke\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3146897				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert Bibliography Entry\</item\> dialog, click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\>, and then \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150741				0	id	Inserting Bibliography Entries From the Bibliography Database				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3148402				0	id	Click in your document where you want to add the bibliography entry.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3148421				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Bibliography Entry\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3153231				0	id	Select \<emph\>From bibliography database\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147059				0	id	Select the name of the bibliography entry that you want to insert in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Short name\</item\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3147085				0	id	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\> and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060				0	id	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120300.xhp\" name=\"Bibliography Database\"\>Bibliography Database\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_literature.xhp	0	help	par_id6367076				0	id	Some external tools exist that can interact with %PRODUCTNAME. One example is called \<link href=\"http://bibus-biblio.sourceforge.net/wiki/index.php/Main_Page\"\>Bibus\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Menggunakan Penggaris				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	bm_id8186284				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>rulers;using rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>horizontal rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>vertical rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>indents; setting on rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>page margins on rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>table cells;adjusting the width on rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>showing;rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hiding;rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adjusting page margins and cell widths\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065F				0	id	\<variable id=\"ruler\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\"\>Menggunakan Penggaris\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067D				0	id	To show or hide rulers, choose \<emph\>View - Ruler\</emph\>. To show the vertical ruler, choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"Writer - View\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - View\</emph\>\</link\>, and then select \<emph\>Vertical ruler\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Ruler\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149686				0	id	Adjusting Page Margins				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3155175				0	id	The margins of a page are indicated by the filled areas at the ends of the rulers.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149038				0	id	Mengubah Indentasi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3153631				0	id	Indents are adjusted with the three small triangles on the horizontal ruler.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3152776	26			0	id	To change the left or the right paragraph indent, select the paragraph(s) that you want change the indent for, drag the bottom left or the bottom right triangle on the horizontal ruler to a new location. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3145769				0	id	To change the first line indent of a selected paragraph, drag the top left triangle on the horizontal ruler to a new location.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	id	You can also double-click anywhere on the horizontal ruler, and adjust the indents in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030000.xhp\" name=\"Paragraph\"\>\<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Numbering and Numbering Styles				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155174				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>numbering; manually/by styles\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>manual numbering in text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>paragraph styles;numbering\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155174	30			0	id	\<variable id=\"using_numbering\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/using_numbering.xhp\" name=\"Numbering and Numbering Styles\"\>Numbering and Numbering Styles\</link\> \</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149818				0	id	You can apply numbering to a paragraph manually or with a paragraph style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id6140629				0	id	To Apply Numbering Manually				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155866				0	id	To apply numbering manually, click in the paragraph, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering On/Off\</item\> icon on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatting\</item\> Bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3153405				0	id	You cannot apply manual numbering to paragraphs that are listed under "Special Styles" in the Styles and Formatting window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10711				0	id	When you press Enter in a numbered or bulleted list, \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> automatically numbers the next paragraph. To remove the numbering or bullet from the new paragraph, press Enter again.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072B				0	id	To change the hierarchical level of a bullet in a list, click in front of the paragraph, then press the Tab key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072F				0	id	To change the bullets or numbering format for the current paragraph only, select a character or word in the paragraph, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</item\>, and then click a new format. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10733				0	id	To change the bullet or numbering format for all paragraphs in the list, ensure that the cursor is in the list, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</item\>, and then click a new format. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	id	To apply the same bullet or numbering format to all paragraphs in the list, select all paragraphs, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</item\>, and then click a format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073A				0	id	You can also use the commands on the \<link href=\"text/swriter/main0206.xhp\" name=\"Numbering Object Bar\"\>Bullets and Numbering\</link\> toolbar to edit a numbered or bulleted list. To change the numbering or bullet format, click the \<emph\>Bullets and Numbering\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153123				0	id	To Apply Numbering With a Paragraph Style				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3153137				0	id	Paragraph Styles give you greater control over numbering that you apply in a document. When you change the numbering format of the style, all paragraphs using the style are automatically updated.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149646				0	id	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Paragraph Styles\</item\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149599				0	id	Right-click the paragraph style that you want to apply numbering to, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149850				0	id	Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Outline & Numbering\</item\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149874				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering Style\</item\> box, select the type of numbering that you want to use.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3145113				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Oke\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3149589				0	id	Apply the style to the paragraphs that you want to add numbering to.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Modifying Rows and Columns by Keyboard				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155856				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>table mode selection\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>proportional distribution of tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>relative distribution of table cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tables; adapting the width by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cells; adapting the width by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>keyboard;modifying the behavior of rows/columns\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>behavior of rows/columns\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155856				0	id	\<variable id=\"tablemode\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/tablemode.xhp\" name=\"Modifying the Behavior of Rows and Columns for Table\"\>Modifying Rows and Columns by Keyboard\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	par_id3149835				0	id	When you insert or delete cells, rows or columns in a table, the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Behavior of rows/columns\</item\> options determine how the neighboring elements are affected. For example, you can only insert new rows and columns into a table with fixed row and column dimensions if space permits.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	par_id7344279				0	id	Note that these properties are valid only for changes to the column width that are made using the keyboard. Using the mouse, you are free to make any column width changes.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	par_id3156110				0	id	To set the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Behavior of rows/columns\</item\> options for tables in text documents, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Table\</item\>, or use the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Fixed\</item\>, \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Fixed/Proportional\</item\>, and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Variable\</item\> icons on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Table\</item\> Bar. There are three display modes for tables:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	par_id3149638				0	id	\<emph\>Fixed\</emph\> - changes only affect the adjacent cell, and not the entire table. For example, when you widen a cell, the adjacent cell becomes narrower, but the width of the table remains constant.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	par_id3149613				0	id	\<emph\>Fixed, proportional\</emph\> - changes affect the entire table, and wide cells shrink more than narrow cells. For example, when you widen a cell, the adjacent cells become proportionally narrower, but the width of the table remains constant.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	par_id3149864				0	id	\<emph\>Variable\</emph\> - changes affect the table size. For example, when you widen a cell, the width of the table increases.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Inserting a Fixed or Variable Date Field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	bm_id5111545				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>inserting;date fields\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>dates;inserting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>date fields;fixed/variable\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>fixed dates\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>variable dates\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155165				0	id	\<variable id=\"fields_date\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/fields_date.xhp\" name=\"Inserting a Fixed or Variable Date Field\"\>Inserting a Fixed or Variable Date Field\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3154491				0	id	You can insert the current date as a field that updates each time you open the document, or as a field that does not update.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3147679				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Fields - Other\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Document\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	id	Click “Date” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list and do one of the following:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3155602				0	id	To insert the date as a field that updates each time you open the document, click ”Date” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Select\</item\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3154241				0	id	To insert the date as a field that does not update, click “Date (fixed)” in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Select\</item\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Menyunting Seksi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149832				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>multi-column text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text; multi-column\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>columns; on text pages\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text columns\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>sections; columns in/use of\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149832				0	id	\<variable id=\"sections\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/sections.xhp\" name=\"Using Sections\"\>Using Sections\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3153128				0	id	Sections are named blocks of text, including graphics or objects, that you can use in a number of ways:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3149284				0	id	To prevent text from being edited.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3149630				0	id	To show or hide text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3149647				0	id	To reuse text and graphics from other $[officename] documents.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3149612				0	id	To insert sections of text that uses a different column layout than the current page style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3149855				0	id	A section contains at least one paragraph. When you select a text and create a section, a paragraph break is automatically inserted at the end of the text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3149872				0	id	You can insert sections from a text document, or an entire text document as a section into another text document. You can also insert sections from a text document as links in another text document, or in the same document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3153367	39			0	id	To insert a new paragraph immediately before or after a section, click in front or behind the section, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154242				0	id	Sections and Columns				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3154255				0	id	You can insert sections into an existing section. For example, you can insert a section containing two columns into a section that contains one column.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\sections.xhp	0	help	par_id3154845				0	id	A section layout, for example on the number of columns, has priority over the page layout defined in a page style.				20181231 09:50:43
