helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id1069368				0	id	You can apply a variety of different cell borders to selected cells in a Writer table and to the whole table. Other objects in text documents can have user defined borders, too. For example, you can assign borders to page styles, to frames, and to inserted pictures or charts.				20181231 09:50:43
