helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id1454512				0	id	A black line sets the corresponding line of the selected cells. The line is shown as a dotted line when you choose the 0.05 pt line style. Double lines are shown when you select a double line style.				20181231 09:50:43
