helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150509				0	id	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Index/Table\</item\> tab, select the name of the user-defined index that you created in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
