helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155870				0	id	To Create a Numbered List From Non-consecutive Paragraphs:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3153417				0	id	Hold down Ctrl and drag a selection in the first numbered paragraph. You only have to select one character.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3149644				0	id	Continue to hold down Ctrl, and drag a selection in each numbered paragraph of the lists you want to combine.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3145102				0	id	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatting\</item\> Bar, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering On/Off\</item\> icon twice.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Calculating and Pasting the Result of a Formula in a Text Document				20181231 09:50:43
