helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155182				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>characters; uppercase or lowercase\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text; uppercase or lowercase\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lowercase letters; text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>uppercase; formatting text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>capital letters;changing to small letters\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>changing;cases of text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>initial capitals in titles\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>small capitals (guide)\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
