helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3153896				0	id	Select the table cells that you want to modify.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3156344	9			0	id	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - (object name) – Borders\</item\>.\<br/\>Replace (object name) with the actual name of the object type you selected.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797				0	id	In the \<emph\>User-defined\</emph\> area select the edge(s) that you want to appear in a common layout. Click on an edge in the preview to toggle the selection of an edge.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	id	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3125865				0	id	Repeat the last two steps for every border edge.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3150447				0	id	Select the distance between the border lines and the page contents in the \<emph\>Spacing to Contents\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3154908				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Oke\</emph\> untuk menerapkan perubahan.				20181231 09:50:43
