helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155525				0	id	$[officename] bisa secara otomatis menerapkan penomoran atau bulatan sembari Anda mengetik.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154243				0	id	Untuk Mengaktifkan Penomoran dan Bulatan Otomatis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3152830	29			0	id	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</item\>, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Options\</item\> tab, and then select “Apply numbering – symbol”.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3152867				0	id	Pilih \<emph\>Format - Format Otomatis\</emph\>, dan pastikan bahwa \<emph\>Sembari Mengetik\</emph\> telah terpilih.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id2357860				0	id	The automatic numbering option is only applied to paragraphs that are formatted with the "Default", "Text body", or "Text body indent" paragraph style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152897				0	id	Untuk Membuat Penomoran atau Daftar Berbulatan Sembari Mengetik				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147773				0	id	Type 1., i., or I. to start a numbered list. Type * or - to start a bulleted list. You can also type a right parenthesis after the number instead of a period , for example, 1) or i).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147794				0	id	Enter a space, type your text, and then press Enter. The new paragraph automatically receives the next number or bullet.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147814				0	id	Tekan Enter lagi untuk menyelesaikan daftar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3147287				0	id	Anda dapat memulai daftar bernomor dengan angka apa saja.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3154083				0	id	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06050000.xhp\" name=\"Format - Numbering/Bullets\"\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
