helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155178				0	id	\<variable id=\"text_direct_cursor\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/text_direct_cursor.xhp\" name=\"Using the Direct Cursor\"\>Using the Direct Cursor\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_id3155908				0	id	The direct cursor allows you to enter text anywhere on a page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_id3155921				0	id	To set the behavior of the direct cursor, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A3				0	id	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools\</item\> bar, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Direct Cursor\</item\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3149846\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_shadowcursor.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149846\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C5				0	id	Click in a free space in the text document. The mouse pointer changes to reflect the alignment that will be applied to the text that you type:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C8				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id5471987\" src=\"res/helpimg/dircursleft.png\" width=\"3.7mm\" height=\"8.2mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5471987\"\>Ikon\</alt\>\</image\> Rata kiri				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E4				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id5730253\" src=\"res/helpimg/dircurscent.png\" width=\"6.09mm\" height=\"8.2mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5730253\"\>Ikon\</alt\>\</image\> Rata tengah				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_idN10700				0	id	\<image id=\"img_id6953622\" src=\"res/helpimg/dircursright.png\" width=\"3.97mm\" height=\"8.2mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id6953622\"\>Ikon\</alt\>\</image\> Rata kanan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071D				0	id	Type your text. %PRODUCTNAME automatically inserts the required number of blank lines, and, if the options are enabled, tabs and spaces.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Thesaurus				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145576				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>thesaurus; related words\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>related words in thesaurus\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>spelling in thesaurus\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>dictionaries; thesaurus\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lexicon, see thesaurus\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>synonyms in thesaurus\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>searching;synonyms\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145576				0	id	\<variable id=\"using_thesaurus\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/using_thesaurus.xhp\" name=\"Thesaurus\"\>Thesaurus\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3149820				0	id	You can use the thesaurus to look up synonyms or related terms.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3155920				0	id	Click in the word that you want to look up or replace.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3155867				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Language - Thesaurus\</emph\>, or press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F7.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3149848				0	id	In the Alternatives list, click an entry to copy that related term to the "Replace with" text box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3153136				0	id	Optionally double-click an entry to look up related terms for that entry. On your keyboard, you can also press the arrow up or down keys to select an entry. Then press Return to replace, or press the spacebar to look up.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3149644				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Hapus\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3156263				0	id	Initially, the thesaurus uses the language of the selected word in the document, if a thesaurus library for that language is installed. The title bar of the Thesaurus dialog displays the language in use.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3145113				0	id	To look up the word in a different language, click the Language button, and select one of the installed thesaurus languages. A thesaurus library may not be available for all installed languages. You can install languages with a thesaurus library from the \<link href=\"https://extensions.openoffice.org/\"\>Extensions\</link\> web page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3196263				0	id	If a thesaurus library is installed for the language of a word, the context menu of the word shows a Synonyms submenu. Select any of the terms from the submenu to replace the word.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3154392				0	id	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06020000.xhp\" name=\"Thesaurus\"\>Thesaurus\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Menyusun Ulang Dokumen dengan Memakai Navigator				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149973				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>headings;rearranging\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>rearranging headings\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>moving;headings\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>demoting heading levels\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>promoting heading levels\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Navigator;heading levels and chapters\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>arranging;headings\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>outlines;arranging chapters\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149973				0	id	\<variable id=\"arrange_chapters\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/arrange_chapters.xhp\" name=\"Rearranging a Document by Using the Navigator\"\>Arranging Chapters in the Navigator\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3147795	59			0	id	You can move headings and subordinate text up and down in a document text by using the Navigator. You can also promote and demote heading levels. To use this feature, format the headings in your document with one of the predefined heading paragraph styles. To use a custom paragraph style for a heading, choose \<emph\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</emph\>, select the style in the \<emph\>Paragraph Style \</emph\>box, and then double-click a number in the \<emph\>Levels \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3145652	62			0	id	To quickly move the text cursor to a heading in the document, double-click the heading in the \<emph\>Navigator \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155461				0	id	To dock the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>, drag the title bar to the edge of the workspace. To undock the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>, double-click its frame.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151184				0	id	Pindah ke sebuah Judul Atas atau Bawah dalam Dokumen				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id0915200809400790				0	id	Memastikan bahwa semua tingkat judul yang akan ditampilkan dalam Navigator. Secara default semua tingkatan yang akan ditampilkan. Lihat langkah-langkah di bawah ini cara untuk mengubah tingkat judul yang ditampilkan.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3151206	71			0	id	On the \<emph\>Standard Bar\</emph\>, click the\<emph\> Navigator\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id5211883\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_navigator.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5211883\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> to open the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3151238	72			0	id	On the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Content View \</emph\>icon \<image id=\"img_id3156338\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20244.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156338\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155089				0	id	Lakukan satu dari langkah-langkah berikut:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155114	63			0	id	Drag a heading to a new location in the \<emph\>Navigator \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155139	75			0	id	Click a heading in the \<emph\>Navigator \</emph\>list, and then click the \<emph\>Promote Chapter\</emph\>\<image id=\"img_id4217546\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20174.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id4217546\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> or \<emph\>Demote Chapter \</emph\>icon \<image id=\"img_id6505788\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20171.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id6505788\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3145758	64			0	id	To move the heading without the subordinate text, hold down Ctrl while you drag or click the \<emph\>Promote Chapter \</emph\>or \<emph\>Demote Chapter \</emph\>icons.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155402				0	id	Untuk Menaikkan atau Menurunkan Tingkat Kepala Tulisan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155424	77			0	id	Pilih kepala tulisan pada daftar \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\>. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_idN1081C				0	id	Click the \<emph\>Promote Level \</emph\>\<image id=\"img_id5564488\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20172.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id5564488\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> or \<emph\>Demote Level \</emph\>icon \<image id=\"img_id3159363\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20173.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3159363\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155525				0	id	To Change the Number of Heading Levels That Are Displayed				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\arrange_chapters.xhp	0	help	par_id3151352	79			0	id	Click the \<emph\>Heading Levels Shown \</emph\>icon \<image id=\"img_id3151310\" src=\"sw/imglst/sc20236.png\" width=\"0.564cm\" height=\"0.564cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151310\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>, and then select a number from the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Hyphenation				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149695				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>hyphenation;manual/automatic\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>separation, see hyphenation\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>automatic hyphenation in text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>manual hyphenation in text\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149695				0	id	\<variable id=\"using_hyphen\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/using_hyphen.xhp\" name=\"Hyphenation\"\>Hyphenation\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3155918	31			0	id	By default, $[officename] moves words that do not fit on a line to the next line. If you want, you can use automatic or manual hyphenation to avoid this behavior: 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155864				0	id	Automatic Hyphenation				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3147414				0	id	Automatic hyphenation inserts hyphens where they are needed in a paragraph. This option is only available for paragraph styles and individual paragraphs.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149832				0	id	To Automatically Hyphenate Text in a Paragraph				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3148850				0	id	Right-click in a paragraph, and choose \<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3156104				0	id	Click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05030200.xhp\" name=\"Text Flow\"\>\<emph\>Text Flow\</emph\>\</link\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3150101				0	id	In the Hyphenation area, select the Automatically check box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3153121				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Oke\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149629				0	id	To Automatically Hyphenate Text in Multiple Paragraphs				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149644				0	id	If you want to automatically hyphenate more than one paragraph, use a paragraph style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149956				0	id	For example, enable the automatic hyphenation option for the "Default" paragraph style, and then apply the style to the paragraphs that you want to hyphenate.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149611				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Paragraph Styles\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149867				0	id	Right-click the paragraph style that you want to hyphenate, and then choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3145106				0	id	Click the Text Flow tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3149582				0	id	In the \<emph\>Hyphenation\</emph\> area, select the \<emph\>Automatically\</emph\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3156250				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Oke\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3145400				0	id	Apply the style to the paragraphs that you want to hyphenate.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145417				0	id	Manual Hyphenation				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154400				0	id	You can insert a hyphen where you want on a line, or let $[officename] search for the words to hyphenate, and then offer a suggested hyphenation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help					0	id	To Manually Hyphenate Single Words				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363				0	id	To quickly insert a hyphen, click in the word where you want to add the hyphen, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Hyphen(-).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154244				0	id	If you insert a manual hyphen in a word, the word is only hyphenated at the manual hyphen. No additional automatic hyphenation is applied for this word. A word with a manual hyphen will be hyphenated without regard to the settings on the \<emph\>Text Flow\</emph\> tab page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154847				0	id	To Manually Hyphenate Text in a Selection				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154869				0	id	Select the text that you want to hyphenate.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3155886				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Language - Hyphenation\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154361				0	id	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05030200.xhp\" name=\"Text Flow\"\>Text Flow\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Calculating Complex Formulas in Text Documents				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147406				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>formulas; complex formulas in text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>calculating;formulas/mean values\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147406				0	id	\<variable id=\"calculate_intext\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/calculate_intext.xhp\" name=\"Calculating Complex Formulas in Text Documents\"\>Calculating Complex Formulas in Text Documents\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3145245				0	id	You can use predefined functions in a formula, and then insert the result of the calculation into a text document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3152901				0	id	For example, to calculate the mean value of three numbers, do the following:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3145078				0	id	Click in the document where you want to insert the formula, and then press F2.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382				0	id	Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formula\</item\> icon, and choose "Mean" from the Statistical Functions list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3149692				0	id	Type the three numbers, separated by vertical slashes (|).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3149481				0	id	Press \<emph\>Enter\</emph\>. The result is inserted as a field into the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_intext.xhp	0	help	par_id3149823				0	id	To edit the formula, double-click the field in the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Inserting a Horizontal Line				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151178				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>horizontal lines\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lines; inserting horizontal lines\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>rules\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting; horizontal lines\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151178				0	id	\<variable id=\"insert_line\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/insert_line.xhp\" name=\"Inserting a Horizontal Line\"\>Inserting a Horizontal Line\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id2165898				0	id	This guide is about inserting graphical rules. You can also insert other lines, see \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/line_intext.xhp\"\>Drawing Lines in Text\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3149691				0	id	Klik pada dokumen Anda di mana Anda hendak menyisipkan indeks.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155186				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Horizontal Rule\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155902	83			0	id	Click the line that you want to insert in the \<emph\>Selection \</emph\>list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3147124				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Oke\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	hd_id5338602				0	id	The "Plain" type				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id5342265				0	id	If you select the "Plain" type of rules, an empty paragraph is inserted at the position of the cursor. This paragraph has the style "Horizontal Line", with a line as the lower border of the paragraph. You can edit that Paragraph Style to change the properties of all "Plain" rules in your document. For example you can set the left indent to 3 inches, or you can change the line style, thickness, and color.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	hd_id707113				0	id	To edit the "Plain" rule style				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id5267494				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\> to open the Styles and Formatting window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id5074922				0	id	In the listbox at the bottom, select to display "All Styles".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id8491470				0	id	Right-click the "Horizontal Line" paragraph style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3253883				0	id	Pilih Ubah.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3196203				0	id	For example, open the Borders tab page to set the thickness and style of the lines. Open the Indents & Spacing tab page to set the indents of the line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	hd_id8385265				0	id	The graphical type				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id2582476				0	id	Select any rule type below of the "Plain" rule type. This inserts a new paragraph at the position of the cursor. A picture showing a graphical horizontal line is inserted.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150217				0	id	The inserted line is anchored to the current paragraph and centered between the page margins.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id2111575				0	id	To edit the graphical line, right-click the line and choose \<emph\>Picture\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150231				0	id	You can also insert one of these lines by dragging it from the \<emph\>Rulers\</emph\> folder in the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> into the current document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150944				0	id	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/gallery.xhp\" name=\"Galeri\"\>Galeri\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Otomatis Memeriksa Ejaan				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154265				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>spellcheck;AutoSpellcheck on/off\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>automatic spellcheck\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>checking spelling;while typing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>words;disabling spellcheck\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154265				0	id	\<variable id=\"auto_spellcheck\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/auto_spellcheck.xhp\" name=\"Automatically Check Spelling\"\>Automatically Check Spelling\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3154664				0	id	You can have $[officename] automatically check spelling while you type and underline possible misspelt words with a red wavy line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154678				0	id	Untuk memeriksa otomatis ejaan saat Anda mengetik:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3155531	42			0	id	Activate the \<emph\>AutoSpellcheck \</emph\>icon on the Standard bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3155569	33			0	id	Right-click a word with a red wavy underline, and then choose a suggested replacement word from the list, or from the \<emph\>AutoCorrect \</emph\>submenu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3147759	6			0	id	If you choose a word from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>AutoCorrect\</item\> submenu, the underlined word and the replacement word are automatically added to the AutoCorrect list for the current language. To view the AutoCorrect list, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools – AutoCorrect Options\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Replace\</item\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3147819				0	id	You can also add the underlined word to your custom dictionary by choosing \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147220				0	id	To Exclude Words From the Spellcheck				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3147263				0	id	Select the words that you want to exclude.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3147282				0	id	Click the Language control on the Status bar to open a menu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3145602				0	id	Choose “None (Do not check spelling)”.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3145648				0	id	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010401.xhp\" name=\"Creating a new dictionary.\"\>Creating a new dictionary.\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	About Fields				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145576				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fields;updating/viewing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>updating;fields\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>Help tips;fields\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>properties;fields\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>disabling;field highlighting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>changing;field shadings\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>viewing;fields\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145576				0	id	\<variable id=\"fields\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/fields.xhp\" name=\"About Fields\"\>About Fields\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3154246				0	id	Fields are used for data that changes in a document, such as the current date or the total number of pages in a document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154262				0	id	Viewing Fields				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3150509				0	id	Fields consist of a field name and the field content. To switch the field display between the field name or the field content, choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/03090000.xhp\" name=\"View - Fields\"\>\<emph\>View - Field Names\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3150536				0	id	To display or hide field highlighting in a document, choose \<emph\>View - Field Shadings\</emph\>. To permanently disable this feature, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Appearance\</emph\>, and clear the check box in front of \<emph\>Field shadings\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3152885				0	id	To change the color of field shadings, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01012000.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] - Appearance\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>$[officename] - Appearance\</item\>\</link\>\</emph\>, locate the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Field shadings\</item\> option, and then select a different color in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Color setting\</item\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153166				0	id	Field Properties				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3153180				0	id	Most field types in a document, including database fields, store and display variable values.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3155533				0	id	The following field types execute an action when you click the field:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3155582				0	id	Field Type				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147760				0	id	Properti				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147789				0	id	Placeholder				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147812				0	id	Opens a dialog to insert the object for which the placeholder was set.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147216				0	id	Menyisipkan Referensi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147239				0	id	Moves the mouse pointer to the reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147267				0	id	Menjalankan makro				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3147290				0	id	Runs a macro.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3145614				0	id	Input Field				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3145637				0	id	Opens a dialog to edit the contents of the field.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3151244				0	id	Placeholder, hidden text, insert reference, variable, database, and user-defined fields display a help tip when you rest the mouse pointer over the field in a document. To enable this feature, ensure that the Extended Tips option (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>What's This?\</item\>) is selected in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Help\</item\> menu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155937				0	id	Updating Fields				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3155963				0	id	To update all of the fields in a document, press F9, or choose \<emph\>Edit - Select All\</emph\>, and then press F9.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3155984				0	id	To update a field that was inserted from a database, select the field, and then press F9.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Memperbaharui Referensi Silang				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145087				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>references; inserting cross-references\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cross-references; inserting and updating\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables; cross-referencing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>pictures; cross-referencing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>objects; cross-referencing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>OLE objects;cross-referencing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>draw objects;cross-referencing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>updating;cross-references\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting;cross-references\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145087				0	id	\<variable id=\"references\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/references.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Cross-References\"\>Inserting Cross-References\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3159263				0	id	Cross-references allow you to jump to specific text passages and objects in a single document. A cross-reference consists of a target and a reference that are inserted as \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/fields.xhp\" name=\"fields\"\>fields\</link\> in the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3155860				0	id	Objects with captions and bookmarks can be used as targets.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149833				0	id	Teks Referensi Silang				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3149846				0	id	Before you can insert a cross-reference, you must first specify the targets in your text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156105				0	id	Untuk menyisipkan target:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3153408				0	id	Select the text that you want to use as a target for the cross-reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3153125				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Cross-reference\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3149634				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list, select “Set Reference”.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3149614				0	id	Type a name for the target in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> box. The selected text is displayed in the \<emph\>Value\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3145110				0	id	Click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\>. The name of the target is added to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Selection\</item\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3156257				0	id	Leave the dialog open and proceed to the next section.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153370				0	id	To Create a Cross-Reference to a Target				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id7032074				0	id	Position the cursor in the text where you want to insert a cross-reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id7796868				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Cross-reference\</emph\> to open the dialog, if it is not open already.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3153392				0	id	In the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> list, select "Insert Reference".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3154256				0	id	In the \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> list, select the target that you want to cross-reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3154856				0	id	In the \<emph\>Insert reference to\</emph\> list, select the format for the cross-reference. The \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090002.xhp\" name=\"format\"\>format\</link\> specifies the type of information that is displayed as the cross-reference. For example, "Reference" inserts the target text, and "Page" inserts the page number where the target is located. For footnotes the footnote number is inserted.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3155895				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Sisip\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3148685				0	id	Click \<emph\>Close\</emph\> when finished.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149980				0	id	Cross-Referencing an Object				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3149992				0	id	You can cross-reference most objects in your document, such as graphics, drawing objects, OLE objects, and tables, so long as they have a caption. To add a caption to an object, select the object, and then choose \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/captions.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Caption\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Caption\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3147123				0	id	Klik pada dokumen Anda di mana Anda hendak menyisipkan indeks.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3150212				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Cross-reference\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3150236				0	id	In the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> list, select the caption category of the object.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3150942				0	id	In the \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> list, select the caption number of the object that you want to cross-reference.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3150968				0	id	In the \<emph\>Insert reference to\</emph\> list, select the format of the cross-reference. The \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090002.xhp\" name=\"format\"\>format\</link\> specifies the type of information that is displayed as the cross-reference. For example, "Reference" inserts the caption category and caption text of the object.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3150535				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Sisip\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3151092				0	id	Click \<emph\>Close\</emph\> when finished.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151115				0	id	Memperbaharui Referensi Silang				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3153594				0	id	To manually update the cross-references in a document, press F9.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id7321390				0	id	Choose \<emph\>View - Fields\</emph\> to switch between viewing the reference names and the reference contents.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\dragdroptext.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Moving and Copying Text in Documents				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\dragdroptext.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155919				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>sections;moving and copying\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>moving; text sections\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>copying; text sections\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>pasting;cut/copied text sections\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>mouse;moving and copying text\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\dragdroptext.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155919				0	id	\<variable id=\"dragdroptext\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/dragdroptext.xhp\" name=\"Moving and Copying Text in Documents\"\>Moving and Copying Text in Documents\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\dragdroptext.xhp	0	help	par_id3152994				0	id	Select the text that you want to move or copy.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\dragdroptext.xhp	0	help	par_id3155606				0	id	Lakukan satu dari langkah-langkah berikut:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\dragdroptext.xhp	0	help	par_id3154236				0	id	To move the selected text, drag the text to a different location in the document and release. While you drag, the mouse pointer changes to include a gray box.\<br/\>\<image id=\"img_id3153148\" src=\"res/helpimg/movedata.png\" width=\"0.3335in\" height=\"0.3335in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153148\"\>Mouse cursor moving data\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\dragdroptext.xhp	0	help	par_id3154257	14			0	id	To copy the selected text, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> while you drag. The mouse pointer changes to include a plus sign (+).\<br/\>\<image id=\"img_id3152868\" src=\"res/helpimg/copydata.png\" width=\"0.3335in\" height=\"0.3335in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152868\"\>Mouse cursor copying data\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Using a Frame to Center Text on a Page				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155177				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>text frames; centering on pages\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>centering;text frames on pages\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>title pages; centering text on\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155177				0	id	\<variable id=\"text_centervert\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/text_centervert.xhp\" name=\"Using a Frame to Center Text on a Page\"\>Using a Frame to Center Text on a Page\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155920				0	id	Select the text that you want to center on the page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155868				0	id	Pilih \<emph\>Sisip - Seksi\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3152765				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Anchor\</item\> area, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>To page\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149844				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Size\</item\> area, set the dimensions of the frame.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3156114				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Position\</item\> area, select "Center" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Horizontal\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Vertical\</item\> boxes.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3153410				0	id	Klik \<emph\>Oke\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149615				0	id	To hide the borders of the frame, select the frame, and then choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Frame/Object\</item\>. Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Borders\</item\> tab, and then click in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Set No Border\</item\> box in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Line Arrangement\</item\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145098				0	id	To resize the frame, drag the edges of the frame.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Using Styles From Another Document or Template				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145086				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>formatting styles; importing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>styles; importing from other files\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>importing;styles from other files\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>loading;styles from other files\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145086				0	id	\<variable id=\"load_styles\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/load_styles.xhp\" name=\"Using Styles From Another Document or Template\"\>Using Styles From Another Document or Template\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3154491				0	id	You can import styles from another document or template into the current document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3155910				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\> to open the \<emph\>Styles and Formatting\</emph\> window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_idN10703				0	id	Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>New Style from Selection\</emph\> icon to open the submenu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070B				0	id	Choose \<emph\>Load styles\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3149632				0	id	Use the check boxes at the bottom of the dialog to select the style types that you want to import. To replace styles in the current document that have the same name as the ones you are importing, select \<emph\>Overwrite\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3145098				0	id	Lakukan satu dari langkah-langkah berikut:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3156240				0	id	Click an entry in the \<emph\>Categories\</emph\> list, then click the template containing the styles that you want to use in the \<emph\>Templates\</emph\> list, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\load_styles.xhp	0	help	par_id3153377				0	id	Click \<emph\>From File\</emph\>, locate the file containing the styles that you want to use, and then click name, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	Changing the Default Template				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155913				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>default templates;defining/resetting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>defaults; templates\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>templates; default templates\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text documents;default templates\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155913				0	id	\<variable id=\"template_default\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/template_default.xhp\" name=\"Changing the Default Template\"\>Changing the Default Template\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3145569				0	id	The default template contains the default formatting information for new text documents. If you want, you can create a new template and use it as the default template.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	hd_id6414990				0	id	To Create a Default Template				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149838				0	id	Create a document and the content and formatting styles that you want.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3156101				0	id	Choose \<emph\>File - Templates - Save\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149283				0	id	In the \<emph\>New Template\</emph\> box, type a name for the new template.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3153409				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Categories\</item\> list, select "My Templates", and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3153140				0	id	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110100.xhp\" name=\"File - Templates - Organize\"\>\<emph\>File - Templates - Organize\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149952				0	id	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Templates\</item\> list, double-click the "My Templates" folder.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149970				0	id	Right-click the template that you created, and choose \<emph\>Set as Default Template\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149620				0	id	Klik\<emph\> Tutup\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149867				0	id	To Reset the Default Template				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3145102				0	id	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01110100.xhp\" name=\"File - Templates - Organize\"\>\<emph\>File - Templates - Organize\</emph\>\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3149582				0	id	Right-click a text file in any of the two lists, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Reset Default Template - Text Document\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\template_default.xhp	0	help	par_id3156245				0	id	Klik\<emph\> Tutup\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
