helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	id	To insert a column, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Insert, release, and then press the left or the right arrow.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3152940				0	id	To delete a column, place the cursor in the column that you want to delete, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Delete, release, and then press the left or the right arrow.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3154105				0	id	To insert a row, place the cursor in a table cell, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Insert, release, and then press the up or the down arrow.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153531				0	id	To delete a row, place the cursor in the row that you want to delete, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and press Delete, release, and then press the up or the down arrow.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05090201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150983				0	id	To change the behavior of tables in a text document, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040500.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Table\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Table\</link\>\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
