helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151182				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_ENDNOTE_OPTIONS\"\>Specifies the formatting for endnotes.\</ahelp\> The type of endnote numbering and the Styles to apply are the options available.				20181231 09:50:43
