helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152952				0	id	Gaya				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06080200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150970				0	id	To ensure a uniform appearance for the endnotes in your document, assign a paragraph style to the footnotes.				20181231 09:50:43
