helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3150343				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_EDIT_TP_FLD_FUNC_ED_FUNCVALUE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets additional function parameters for fields. The type of parameter depends on the field type that you select.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3151242				0	id	Depending on the field type that you select, you can assign conditions to certain functions. For example, you can define a field that executes a macro when you click the field in the document, or a condition that, when met, hides a field. You can also define placeholder fields that insert graphics, tables, frames and other objects into your document when needed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id0902200804352037				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Lists the available field types. To add a field to your document, click a field type, click a field in the \<emph\>Select \</emph\>list, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537				0	id	Jenis				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3155623				0	id	Arti				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3152999				0	id	Teks kondisional				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149881	6			0	id	Inserts text if a certain \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"condition\"\>condition\</link\> is met. For example, enter "sun eq 1" in the \<emph\>Condition\</emph\> box, and then the text that you want to insert when the variable "sun" equals "1" in the \<emph\>Then \</emph\>box. If you want, you can also enter the text that you want to display when this condition is not met in the \<emph\>Else\</emph\> box. To define the variable "sun", click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090005.xhp\" name=\"Variables\"\>\<emph\>Variables\</emph\>\</link\> tab, select "Set variable", type "sun" in the\<emph\> Name\</emph\> box, and its value in the\<emph\> Value\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153719				0	id	Senarai input				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147564				0	id	Inserts a text field that displays one item from a list. You can add, edit, and remove items, and change their order in the list. Click an \<emph\>Input list\</emph\> field in your document or press Ctrl+Shift+F9 to display the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090003.xhp\" name=\"Choose Item\"\>\<emph\>Choose Item\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153146				0	id	Ruas input				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3149287				0	id	Inserts a text field that you can open by \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090100.xhp\" name=\"clicking\"\>clicking\</link\> it in the document. You can then change the text that is displayed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3154691				0	id	Jalankan makro				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147515	10			0	id	Inserts a text field that runs a macro when you click the field in the document. To assign a macro to the field, click the \<emph\>Macro\</emph\> button. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3152946				0	id	Placeholder				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	id	Inserts a placeholder field in the document, for example, for graphics. When you click a placeholder field in the document, you are prompted to insert the item that is missing.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3150973				0	id	Teks tersembunyi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147524				0	id	Inserts a text field that is hidden when the condition that you specify is met. To use this function, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\> and clear the \<emph\>Fields: Hidden text\</emph\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3154480				0	id	Paragraf Tersembunyi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3153677				0	id	Hides a paragraph when the condition that you specify is met. To use this function, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Text Document - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\> and clear the \<emph\>Fields: Hidden paragraph\</emph\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3154192	39			0	id	Kombinasikan karakter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3159199				0	id	Combines up to 6 characters, so that they behave as a single character. This feature is only available when Asian fonts are supported.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id0902200804352213				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click the format that you want to apply to the selected field, or click "Additional formats" to define a custom format.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3151329				0	id	For function fields, the format field is only used for fields of the type placeholder. Here, the format determines the object for which the placeholder stands.				20181231 09:50:43
