helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157875				0	id	To enable this feature, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040600.xhp\" name=\"Writer - Formatting Aids\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</link\>\</emph\>, and ensure that the \<emph\>Hidden paragraphs\</emph\> check box in the \<emph\>Display of\</emph\> area is selected.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\03140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154501				0	id	Gunakan \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"perintah ruas\"\>perintah ruas\</link\> "Paragraf Tersembunyi" untuk membuat \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090200.xhp\" name=\"kondisi\"\>kondisi\</link\> yang harus dipenuhi untuk menyembunyikan paragraf. Jika kondisi tidak dipenuhi, paragraf akan tampak.				20181231 09:50:43
