helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154765				0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EntireColumn\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Selects the column that contains the cursor.\</ahelp\> This option is only available if the cursor is in a table.				20181231 09:50:43
