helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149871	2			0	id	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoFormatApply\"\>Automatically formats the file according to the options that you set under \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect\</emph\>            \<emph\>Options\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147404				0	id	When you apply automatic formats, the following rules apply:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155625				0	id	AutoCorrect for Headings				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154505				0	id	A paragraph is formatted as a heading when the following conditions are met:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145241				0	id	paragraf dimulai dengan huruf kapital				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148386				0	id	paragraph does not end with a punctuation mark				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150564				0	id	paragraf kosong di atas maupun bawah paragraf				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149030				0	id	Otoformat untuk Bulatan / Penomoran				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3156316				0	id	To create a bulleted list, type a hyphen (-), star (*), or plus sign (+), followed by a space or tab at the beginning of a paragraph.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150763	18			0	id	To create a numbered list, type a number followed by a period (.), followed by a space or tab at the beginning of a paragraph. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147507				0	id	Automatic numbering is only applied to paragraphs formatted with the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\>, \<emph\>Text body\</emph\> or \<emph\>Text body indent\</emph\> paragraph styles.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152941				0	id	Otoformat untuk Garis Pemisah				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154105				0	id	If you type three or more hyphens (---), underscores (___) or equal signs (===) on line and then press Enter, the paragraph is replaced by a horizontal line as wide as the page. The line is actually the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"lower border\"\>lower border\</link\> of the preceding paragraph. The following rules apply:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153530				0	id	Three hyphens (-) yield a single line (0.05 pt thick, gap 0.75 mm).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154477				0	id	Three underscore (_) yield a single line (1 pt thick, gap 0.75 mm).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150982				0	id	Three equal signs (=) yield a double line (1.10 pt thick, gap 0.75 mm).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	id	AutoCorrect				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153925				0	id	\<bookmark_value\>fungsi OtoFormat; dokumen teks\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
