helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155625				0	id	Default settings				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149352				0	id	You can select from predefined column layouts, or create your own. When you apply a layout to a page style, all pages that use the style are updated. Similarly, when you apply a column layout to a frame style, all frames that use that style are updated. You can also change the column layout for a single frame.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154562				0	id	Kolom				20181231 09:50:43
